<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.300" end="00:00:02.600" style="s2">everything just</p>
<p begin="00:00:01.600" end="00:00:04.200" style="s2">stopped.</p>
<p begin="00:00:02.600" end="00:00:06.400" style="s2">He remembers everyone,</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.200" end="00:00:07.900" style="s2">just not me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.400" end="00:00:10.700" style="s2">But it doesn&#39;t matter.</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.900" end="00:00:12.400" style="s2">I can give up everything, work, sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.700" end="00:00:14.100" style="s2">None of it matters.</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.400" end="00:00:15.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian, how long are you really going</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.100" end="00:00:16.800" style="s2">to keep this [music] amnesia thing</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.100" end="00:00:18.200" style="s2">going? Elena&#39;s been running herself into</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.800" end="00:00:19.300" style="s2">the ground for you.</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.200" end="00:00:21.400" style="s2">What if the whole engagement thing was</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.300" end="00:00:23.000" style="s2">just a misunderstanding? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.400" end="00:00:24.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A misunderstanding?</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.000" end="00:00:26.400" style="s2">I saw her dad take her to meet some old</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.600" end="00:00:29.300" style="s2">money developer. They were talking</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.400" end="00:00:30.600" style="s2">funding, marriage, deals. She&#39;s planning</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.300" end="00:00:32.099" style="s2">a wedding with me while lining up her</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.600" end="00:00:32.800" style="s2">next option, and you&#39;re calling that</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.099" end="00:00:34.500" style="s2">sincere?</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.800" end="00:00:36.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be so hard on her, Sebastian. She</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.500" end="00:00:37.800" style="s2">didn&#39;t have much choice. Blackwood</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.000" end="00:00:39.400" style="s2">Holdings is barely hanging on. If she</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.800" end="00:00:40.800" style="s2">doesn&#39;t lock in the Kingsley Trust or</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.400" end="00:00:41.900" style="s2">find someone even richer, how she</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.800" end="00:00:43.900" style="s2">supposed to keep up that lifestyle?</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.900" end="00:00:45.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So this whole devoted fiance act, she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.900" end="00:00:47.200" style="s2">just scared I might actually forget her</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.600" end="00:00:49.200" style="s2">and lose her shot at the inheritance.</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.200" end="00:00:51.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honestly, I almost feel bad for her,</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.200" end="00:00:53.400" style="s2">dressing like some cheap housekeeper,</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.100" end="00:00:55.400" style="s2">sitting here all day. It&#39;s kind of sad.</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.400" end="00:00:56.700" style="s2">Doesn&#39;t it kill your appetite?</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.400" end="00:00:58.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.700" end="00:01:00.260" style="s2">It does.</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.950" end="00:01:02.280" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.260" end="00:01:02.280" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.535" end="00:01:08.200" style="s2">[gasps] Sebastian, is it really that I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.400" end="00:01:08.200" style="s2">not good enough?</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.400" end="00:01:14.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian, I gave you 10 years, all of</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.500" end="00:01:14.725" style="s2">me. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.000" end="00:01:19.600" style="s2">Now you get 100 chances.</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.500" end="00:01:22.800" style="s2">Disappoint [music] me 100 times, and I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.600" end="00:01:22.800" style="s2">gone for good.</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.500" end="00:01:26.000" style="s2">That&#39;s one.</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.400" end="00:01:50.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait a moment. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.600" end="00:01:52.300" style="s2">Put it over there.</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.200" end="00:01:54.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian,</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.300" end="00:01:58.000" style="s2">what is this?</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.600" end="00:01:59.100" style="s2">Why are my things out in the hall?</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.000" end="00:02:00.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, you&#39;ve been taking care of me</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.100" end="00:02:02.692" style="s2">this past month. I get that, but right</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.992" end="00:02:03.292" style="s2">now you&#39;re stranger to me. I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.692" end="00:02:05.392" style="s2">remember you.</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.292" end="00:02:07.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A stranger? We&#39;ve been together 10</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.392" end="00:02:08.892" style="s2">years. Our wedding&#39;s in a few days.</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.092" end="00:02:11.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The wedding&#39;s off. Being around someone</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.892" end="00:02:13.492" style="s2">I don&#39;t remember it&#39;s exhausting.</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.492" end="00:02:15.392" style="s2">Isabella is my family. I&#39;m more at ease</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.492" end="00:02:15.992" style="s2">with her here, so</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.392" end="00:02:17.892" style="s2">move out.</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.992" end="00:02:20.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t blame him, sis. His head&#39;s still</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.892" end="00:02:21.992" style="s2">all over the place. The doctor said he</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.092" end="00:02:23.392" style="s2">needs peace and quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.992" end="00:02:24.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Peace and quiet?</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.392" end="00:02:27.292" style="s2">Or you just couldn&#39;t wait to take my</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.792" end="00:02:27.292" style="s2">place?</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.692" end="00:02:33.992" style="s2">Wow. That brooch is stunning. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.092" end="00:02:35.392" style="s2">Sebastian, I want it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.992" end="00:02:37.192" style="s2">Sebastian, look at me. You really don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.392" end="00:02:38.511" style="s2">remember this? It&#39;s the only thing my</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.192" end="00:02:40.531" style="s2">mom left me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.511" end="00:02:40.531" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.092" end="00:02:48.392" style="s2">Sebastian, come on. I really love this</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.792" end="00:02:50.692" style="s2">one. I want it. Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.392" end="00:02:52.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If she wants it, set a price. I&#39;ll take</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.692" end="00:02:52.892" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.392" end="00:02:56.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.747" end="00:03:07.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.292" end="00:03:07.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here. Take it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.607" end="00:03:12.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.092" end="00:03:25.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian, once something&#39;s broken, it</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.592" end="00:03:25.672" style="s2">stays broken.</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.017" end="00:03:27.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.672" end="00:03:27.692" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.092" end="00:03:33.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, what the hell were you thinking?</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.792" end="00:03:35.092" style="s2">You threw Sebastian&#39;s black card in his</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.292" end="00:03:36.592" style="s2">face? Do you have any idea how badly we</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.092" end="00:03:37.992" style="s2">need Kingsley money right now?</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.592" end="00:03:39.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You pushed me into that marriage and</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.992" end="00:03:40.492" style="s2">called it a business dinner. Back then</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.492" end="00:03:42.592" style="s2">you weren&#39;t worried about offending the</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.492" end="00:03:43.692" style="s2">Kingsmans. Now suddenly you care? You</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.592" end="00:03:45.092" style="s2">were ready to sell your own daughter</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.692" end="00:03:46.592" style="s2">just to patch up your financial mess.</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.092" end="00:03:48.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. I&#39;m your father. You&#39;re going</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.592" end="00:03:49.192" style="s2">back to the Kingsmans and apologizing.</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.092" end="00:03:50.292" style="s2">And if that means getting on your knees,</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.192" end="00:03:51.292" style="s2">then you get on your knees until</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.292" end="00:03:53.292" style="s2">Sebastian forgives you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.292" end="00:03:54.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, Elena, it was just a chipped brooch.</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.292" end="00:03:55.792" style="s2">Did you really have to make it the talk</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.392" end="00:03:56.992" style="s2">of the entire city? With that kind of</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.792" end="00:03:57.492" style="s2">temper, no elite family is ever going to</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.992" end="00:03:59.292" style="s2">put up with you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.492" end="00:04:00.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was the Blackwood star. The only</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.292" end="00:04:02.092" style="s2">thing my mother left me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.992" end="00:04:02.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You care that much? Take this. Some</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.092" end="00:04:02.592" style="s2">piece</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.294" end="00:04:03.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; of</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.592" end="00:04:04.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; wore last</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.094" end="00:04:07.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; year. Still worth a fortune. Pick one</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.094" end="00:04:07.094" style="s2">and call it even with your sister.</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.494" end="00:04:14.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mother&#39;s dignity doesn&#39; come from</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.994" end="00:04:14.594" style="s2">leftovers. You ungrateful.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.894" end="00:04:20.394" style="s2">Starting today, I&#39;m done being the</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.994" end="00:04:21.594" style="s2">Blackwood family&#39;s bargaining pawn.</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.394" end="00:04:25.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So now you&#39;re too tough to listen to</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.594" end="00:04:25.294" style="s2">your own father, huh? You&#39;re dead to me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.894" end="00:04:41.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, [music] have some soup. I know</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.894" end="00:04:42.194" style="s2">things haven&#39;t been easy for you over</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.494" end="00:04:44.494" style="s2">there.</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.194" end="00:04:46.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m okay, uncle. Honestly, leaving that</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.494" end="00:04:47.894" style="s2">place feels like I can finally breathe</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.194" end="00:04:50.694" style="s2">again. You should get some rest. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.894" end="00:04:50.694" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry about me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.994" end="00:04:57.394" style="s2">My father&#39;s [music] betrayal,</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.894" end="00:04:59.594" style="s2">my stepmother&#39;s humiliation, once the</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.394" end="00:05:01.094" style="s2">disappointment adds up,</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.594" end="00:05:03.594" style="s2">I disappear from every one of your</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.094" end="00:05:03.594" style="s2">worlds.</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.694" end="00:05:18.094" style="s2">Sebastian, you still haven&#39;t answered</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.894" end="00:05:22.094" style="s2">me. So tell me, do you like my body more</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.094" end="00:05:22.094" style="s2">or my sister&#39;s cold, uptick soul?</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.594" end="00:05:37.394" style="s2">Sebastian, you just turned the last</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.794" end="00:05:40.394" style="s2">piece of what we had into trash.</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.394" end="00:05:40.394" style="s2">Congratulations.</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.913" end="00:05:43.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.594" end="00:05:50.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isabella,</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.694" end="00:05:51.794" style="s2">what are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.394" end="00:05:53.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian, you were really out of it</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.794" end="00:05:55.594" style="s2">last night. It&#39;s fine. I&#39;m not blaming</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.494" end="00:05:55.594" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.394" end="00:05:59.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.694" end="00:06:02.294" style="s2">What&#39;s done is done. I&#39;ll take care of</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.994" end="00:06:03.794" style="s2">it. [music] Starting today,</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.294" end="00:06:04.994" style="s2">you&#39;re with me</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.794" end="00:06:06.695" style="s2">officially.</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.994" end="00:06:08.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really, Sebastian? I</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.695" end="00:06:09.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; don&#39;t care about titles. I just want to</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.095" end="00:06:11.295" style="s2">stay by your side.</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.295" end="00:06:14.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. [music] I want Elena to see this.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.295" end="00:06:14.695" style="s2">Without me, she&#39;s nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.295" end="00:06:24.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; keep breaking my heart over and over.</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.095" end="00:06:31.095" style="s2">This is the very last chance I&#39;m giving</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.795" end="00:06:31.095" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.595" end="00:06:37.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Glad you all made it.</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.895" end="00:06:38.895" style="s2">Quick update.</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.395" end="00:06:40.695" style="s2">My engagement&#39;s changed. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.895" end="00:06:44.295" style="s2">My ex-fiancée</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.695" end="00:06:46.095" style="s2">cheated and greedy as hell.</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.295" end="00:06:49.195" style="s2">So from today on,</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.095" end="00:06:49.195" style="s2">it&#39;s Isabella Blackburn.</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.295" end="00:06:52.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you out of your mind? You didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.795" end="00:06:55.395" style="s2">tell your parents and you&#39;re dropping</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.995" end="00:06:55.395" style="s2">this here?</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.495" end="00:07:07.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow, the Kingsland&#39;s reject showed up.</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.295" end="00:07:11.295" style="s2">No shame at all. Probably here to beg</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.395" end="00:07:11.295" style="s2">for him back. That&#39;s embarrassing.</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.395" end="00:07:22.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Made up your mind? Say yes, and I redraw</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.095" end="00:07:22.695" style="s2">the tire obsidian for you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.395" end="00:07:27.895" style="s2">I&#39;m in.</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.265" end="00:07:36.395" style="s2">[music] 100</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.795" end="00:07:43.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, what&#39;s your deal? Still</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.695" end="00:07:45.295" style="s2">pretending you don&#39;t care?</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.795" end="00:07:47.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10 years.</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.295" end="00:07:50.595" style="s2">Buried it myself. Now it&#39;s your turn to</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.995" end="00:07:50.595" style="s2">be the prey.</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.295" end="00:08:02.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is this?</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.795" end="00:08:05.195" style="s2">This isn&#39;t like her.</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.695" end="00:08:06.495" style="s2">She should be breaking down,</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.195" end="00:08:07.897" style="s2">calling me,</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.495" end="00:08:12.297" style="s2">showing up at the gates trying to</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.897" end="00:08:12.297" style="s2">explain. So, why did she just disappear?</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.197" end="00:08:19.397" style="s2">Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.197" end="00:08:20.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just thought you might need someone.</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.397" end="00:08:24.397" style="s2">I can stay with you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.697" end="00:08:24.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said get out, you deaf.</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.397" end="00:08:44.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena Blackburn,</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.897" end="00:08:45.797" style="s2">you&#39;ve lost everything. I can help you</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.597" end="00:08:46.897" style="s2">take it back.</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.797" end="00:08:48.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is this?</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.897" end="00:08:51.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone who can pull you out of the</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.097" end="00:08:53.176" style="s2">dirt. Move into my estate. Trust me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.697" end="00:08:53.397" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you back what&#39;s yours.</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.176" end="00:08:55.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.397" end="00:08:56.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And make the Kingslands pay for their</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.097" end="00:08:59.097" style="s2">arrogance.</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.297" end="00:09:00.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why help me? What do you get out of it?</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.097" end="00:09:02.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Helping you helps me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.997" end="00:09:04.311" style="s2">As for terms, I want your trust, nothing</p>
<p begin="00:09:02.697" end="00:09:04.797" style="s2">less.</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.311" end="00:09:07.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.797" end="00:09:09.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve never met, but in that moment,</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.697" end="00:09:11.897" style="s2">I felt it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.097" end="00:09:13.397" style="s2">Something I hadn&#39;t felt in a long time.</p>
<p begin="00:09:11.897" end="00:09:16.197" style="s2">Respect [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.397" end="00:09:16.197" style="s2">and safety.</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.897" end="00:09:19.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena,</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.097" end="00:09:21.397" style="s2">what are you up to?</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.597" end="00:09:23.697" style="s2">You&#39;re not getting out of this. Not from</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.397" end="00:09:23.697" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.926" end="00:09:27.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.897" end="00:09:33.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, you love the stars and these</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.697" end="00:09:36.897" style="s2">flowers.</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.897" end="00:09:38.497" style="s2">I kept it all the same for you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.897" end="00:09:40.697" style="s2">When we see each other at the wedding,</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.497" end="00:09:43.897" style="s2">I&#39;ll tell you I remember everything.</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.697" end="00:09:43.897" style="s2">All 10 years.</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.897" end="00:09:51.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh, Mr. Kingsley, Ms. Blackwood stopped</p>
<p begin="00:09:49.097" end="00:09:53.697" style="s2">by 2 days ago. She was here for what?</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.297" end="00:09:55.497" style="s2">She came as the former planner, cleared</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.697" end="00:09:56.297" style="s2">the remaining balance, all of it. She</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.497" end="00:09:57.097" style="s2">also said</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.297" end="00:09:59.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Said what?</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.097" end="00:10:01.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She suggested switching the champagne to</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.097" end="00:10:04.397" style="s2">a 1998 vintage. [music] Said it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.897" end="00:10:06.797" style="s2">your least favorite. She mentioned it</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.397" end="00:10:08.298" style="s2">fits Ms. Isabella&#39;s taste better.</p>
<p begin="00:10:06.797" end="00:10:10.898" style="s2">Since the bride&#39;s changed, the champagne</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.298" end="00:10:10.898" style="s2">should match.</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.498" end="00:10:15.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The number you are calling is currently</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.098" end="00:10:18.898" style="s2">busy.</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.398" end="00:10:20.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She blocked me? Seriously?</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.898" end="00:10:22.098" style="s2">Ethan, what&#39;s going on with her? Still</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.698" end="00:10:22.898" style="s2">hiding in that crappy place in Ironwood</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.098" end="00:10:25.198" style="s2">crying non-stop?</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.898" end="00:10:26.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian, I just passed Uncle Roberts.</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.198" end="00:10:28.598" style="s2">She&#39;s fine, working in the shop,</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.798" end="00:10:30.398" style="s2">handling orders like nothing happened.</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.598" end="00:10:31.698" style="s2">Honestly, it&#39;s kind of unsettling how</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.398" end="00:10:34.198" style="s2">calm she is.</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.698" end="00:10:36.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, she&#39;s acting. That&#39;s her thing.</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.198" end="00:10:37.498" style="s2">10 years with me, no way she&#39;s just over</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.198" end="00:10:37.898" style="s2">it. She&#39;s putting on a show for</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.498" end="00:10:39.498" style="s2">everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.898" end="00:10:40.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen to me. [music] You crossed a line</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.498" end="00:10:43.298" style="s2">this time.</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.998" end="00:10:45.698" style="s2">Faking amnesia to test her, pushing</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.298" end="00:10:46.798" style="s2">Isabella in her place, Elena might not</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.698" end="00:10:48.898" style="s2">come back.</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.798" end="00:10:50.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.898" end="00:10:52.198" style="s2">You don&#39;t know her.</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.798" end="00:10:54.198" style="s2">She&#39;s waiting for me to go get her.</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.198" end="00:10:56.398" style="s2">She&#39;ll be at the wedding. No way she</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.198" end="00:10:58.498" style="s2">walks away from being Mrs. Kingsley, and</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.398" end="00:11:00.898" style="s2">she&#39;s definitely not walking away from</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.498" end="00:11:00.898" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.598" end="00:11:15.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isabella, [music] what is this? Why are</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.898" end="00:11:17.277" style="s2">you dressed like a bride? Where&#39;s Elena?</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.298" end="00:11:19.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Kingsley,</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.277" end="00:11:21.298" style="s2">[music] Sebastian asked me to get ready.</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.898" end="00:11:22.998" style="s2">He said</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.298" end="00:11:25.198" style="s2">my sister might not come.</p>
<p begin="00:11:22.998" end="00:11:27.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s absurd. A Kingsley wedding</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.198" end="00:11:28.298" style="s2">doesn&#39;t swap in some illegitimate girl</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.398" end="00:11:30.498" style="s2">last minute.</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.298" end="00:11:33.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I&#39;ll explain later.</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.498" end="00:11:34.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Later? Your father&#39;s outside right now,</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.098" end="00:11:35.298" style="s2">and you&#39;re seriously to walk her out</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.198" end="00:11:38.098" style="s2">there and embarrass this family?</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.298" end="00:11:38.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said later.</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.498" end="00:11:47.098" style="s2">Sir,</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.398" end="00:11:49.398" style="s2">we tracked her. Miss Blackwood left</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.098" end="00:11:49.898" style="s2">early this morning with her luggage.</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.398" end="00:11:51.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where?</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.898" end="00:11:53.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No destination.</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.398" end="00:11:56.698" style="s2">Cameras show she walked out, didn&#39;t look</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.898" end="00:11:58.898" style="s2">back once.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.698" end="00:12:01.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.898" end="00:12:01.598" style="s2">She wouldn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.698" end="00:12:06.458" style="s2">She wouldn&#39;t just leave.</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.438" end="00:12:06.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.299" end="00:12:20.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian, what the hell is this?</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.999" end="00:12:26.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got to be kidding. The Kingsley&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.499" end="00:12:27.699" style="s2">are marrying the illegitimate daughter?</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.099" end="00:12:30.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena really dumped him. This whole</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.699" end="00:12:30.899" style="s2">thing&#39;s a disaster.</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.599" end="00:12:37.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s gone.</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.399" end="00:12:37.399" style="s2">I drove her away.</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.299" end="00:12:51.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From a neurological standpoint, your</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.099" end="00:12:51.899" style="s2">reaction makes perfect [music] sense.</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.499" end="00:12:55.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, the car is ready.</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.873" end="00:12:56.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.199" end="00:13:00.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just Elena is fine.</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.399" end="00:13:00.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry. Mr. Sinclair was very clear.</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.144" end="00:13:19.164" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.599" end="00:13:23.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena,</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.099" end="00:13:25.399" style="s2">welcome to your new [music] world.</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.599" end="00:13:26.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought you&#39;d ask why I walked out.</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.399" end="00:13:28.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If it&#39;s trash, you toss it.</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.999" end="00:13:31.699" style="s2">No explanation [music] needed.</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.699" end="00:13:33.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Standing in front of him, I trust him.</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.699" end="00:13:35.499" style="s2">I don&#39;t even know why.</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.199" end="00:13:37.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not dead. Good. Then get up.</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.499" end="00:13:38.599" style="s2">You&#39;ve humiliated this family enough.</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.399" end="00:13:40.399" style="s2">All this</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.599" end="00:13:41.799" style="s2">for a woman? Pathetic.</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.399" end="00:13:44.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.799" end="00:13:45.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena. Don&#39;t say her name. She&#39;s a joke</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.099" end="00:13:47.499" style="s2">now, and you&#39;re the headline. I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.799" end="00:13:49.999" style="s2">have a son who makes a fool of himself</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.499" end="00:13:49.999" style="s2">like this.</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.099" end="00:13:54.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You hear about him? That Kingsley heir</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.299" end="00:13:58.299" style="s2">got played hard. Girl walked out on the</p>
<p begin="00:13:54.999" end="00:13:58.299" style="s2">wedding. Just left [music] him there.</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.299" end="00:14:04.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out. ALL OF YOU, GET OUT!</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.099" end="00:14:07.699" style="s2">ELENA,</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.299" end="00:14:07.699" style="s2">YOU&#39;RE NOT GETTING AWAY [music] FROM ME.</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.099" end="00:14:14.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Try it. Skin milk, no sugar, your usual</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.999" end="00:14:14.899" style="s2">low cal latte.</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.199" end="00:14:21.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do you know I take it?</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.901" end="00:14:21.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Knowing my partners is part of the job.</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.501" end="00:14:26.801" style="s2">You walked out of that hotel.</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.801" end="00:14:29.801" style="s2">That means you&#39;ve decided.</p>
<p begin="00:14:26.801" end="00:14:31.201" style="s2">Elena, [music] marry me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.801" end="00:14:32.470" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A contract marriage?</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.201" end="00:14:33.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It cuts you free from the Black House</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.470" end="00:14:35.001" style="s2">[music] and gives you the leverage to go</p>
<p begin="00:14:33.801" end="00:14:36.001" style="s2">after the Kingsleys.</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.001" end="00:14:38.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.001" end="00:14:40.101" style="s2">But I have conditions. First, Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.601" end="00:14:41.801" style="s2">Capital does not invest a cent in</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.101" end="00:14:43.301" style="s2">Blackwood Real Estate. I want [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:41.801" end="00:14:46.401" style="s2">your help cutting all legal ties with</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.301" end="00:14:48.601" style="s2">Charles completely. Second, you protect</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.401" end="00:14:51.601" style="s2">my uncle Robert&#39;s workshop. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.601" end="00:14:51.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy. Done.</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.401" end="00:15:00.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about you?</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.201" end="00:15:03.001" style="s2">What do you get out of this?</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.701" end="00:15:03.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Trust.</p>
<p begin="00:15:03.001" end="00:15:05.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Trust?</p>
<p begin="00:15:03.801" end="00:15:08.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t need a partner who just brings</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.401" end="00:15:09.501" style="s2">value. I need a wife who trusts me</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.501" end="00:15:11.001" style="s2">completely.</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.501" end="00:15:13.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If this were just a deal, I&#39;d sign</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.001" end="00:15:15.701" style="s2">without a second thought. But 10 years</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.101" end="00:15:16.901" style="s2">ended in a test, a cruel one.</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.701" end="00:15:18.101" style="s2">Do I really have it in me to trust</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.901" end="00:15:20.601" style="s2">someone again?</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.101" end="00:15:23.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No rush. Trust takes time.</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.601" end="00:15:23.101" style="s2">We build it.</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.501" end="00:15:26.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m in.</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.501" end="00:15:30.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.901" end="00:15:32.701" style="s2">From this moment on,</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.601" end="00:15:35.101" style="s2">Mo Wan on Obsidian Island lays a finger</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.701" end="00:15:35.101" style="s2">on you.</p>
<p begin="00:15:40.801" end="00:15:44.601" style="s2">Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.801" end="00:15:44.601" style="s2">Let&#39;s see your new home.</p>
<p begin="00:15:48.301" end="00:15:54.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The sofa, the paintings, it&#39;s exactly</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.601" end="00:15:56.310" style="s2">like the dream home I saved years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.345" end="00:15:58.275" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:56.310" end="00:16:00.295" style="s2">[gasps and laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:15:58.275" end="00:16:00.295" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.501" end="00:16:04.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Long trip. Drink this [music] first.</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.801" end="00:16:08.401" style="s2">From now on, this place is yours. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.701" end="00:16:08.401" style="s2">like something? Swap it out.</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.501" end="00:16:16.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Alexander.</p>
<p begin="00:16:13.801" end="00:16:19.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve been with him for years. Never ever</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.001" end="00:16:19.302" style="s2">him treat anyone like this.</p>
<p begin="00:16:20.002" end="00:16:23.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back off. Leave him alone.</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.102" end="00:16:32.102" style="s2">Here, eat it.</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.802" end="00:16:37.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back then,</p>
<p begin="00:16:35.102" end="00:16:39.002" style="s2">you were the only light in my world.</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.802" end="00:16:41.602" style="s2">This time,</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.002" end="00:16:41.602" style="s2">I&#39;ve got you.</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.202" end="00:16:47.702" style="s2">If we&#39;re doing this, [music] sign that</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.602" end="00:16:50.802" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.702" end="00:16:53.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A prenup? Alexander, half your assets</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.802" end="00:16:55.916" style="s2">transferred to me after we&#39;re married?</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.902" end="00:16:57.502" style="s2">This is too much. I can&#39;t take it.</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.916" end="00:16:59.002" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.502" end="00:17:01.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sign it.</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.002" end="00:17:03.902" style="s2">That&#39;s your security</p>
<p begin="00:17:01.102" end="00:17:03.902" style="s2">and your leverage.</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.102" end="00:17:16.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it? Worried I&#39;ll bail? We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.602" end="00:17:17.502" style="s2">still stuck on the half I just gave</p>
<p begin="00:17:16.802" end="00:17:18.702" style="s2">away?</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.502" end="00:17:21.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please.</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.702" end="00:17:24.102" style="s2">Like I care about your money. It just</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.402" end="00:17:25.502" style="s2">happened so fast. Feels unreal.</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.102" end="00:17:27.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then stay in it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.502" end="00:17:29.802" style="s2">Sign it, Mrs. St. Clair. Don&#39;t keep the</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.102" end="00:17:29.802" style="s2">next couple waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:17:35.702" end="00:17:40.102" style="s2">It yours. Starting today, you stand on</p>
<p begin="00:17:37.802" end="00:17:42.702" style="s2">your own. You don&#39;t depend on anyone,</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.102" end="00:17:42.702" style="s2">including me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.202" end="00:17:46.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really didn&#39;t have to do all this.</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.502" end="00:17:48.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.702" end="00:17:49.702" style="s2">I don&#39;t want someone who needs me. I</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.402" end="00:17:51.702" style="s2">want you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.702" end="00:17:52.602" style="s2">Someone who chooses this, who chooses</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.702" end="00:17:53.802" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.602" end="00:17:55.402" style="s2">That&#39;s all.</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.802" end="00:17:57.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For the first time,</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.402" end="00:17:59.902" style="s2">this cold city finally feels like it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.302" end="00:17:59.902" style="s2">clearing up.</p>
<p begin="00:18:01.902" end="00:18:07.312" style="s2">Even the truffle slices,</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.202" end="00:18:07.902" style="s2">this is exactly how I like it.</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.312" end="00:18:09.402" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.902" end="00:18:11.202" style="s2">How did you manage that?</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.402" end="00:18:12.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Knowing what my wife likes, that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.202" end="00:18:13.902" style="s2">basic.</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.102" end="00:18:15.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian never let me eat stuff like</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.902" end="00:18:17.102" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.302" end="00:18:19.002" style="s2">Said carbs and fat would ruin a</p>
<p begin="00:18:17.102" end="00:18:20.502" style="s2">socialite&#39;s figure.</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.002" end="00:18:22.377" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s his loss.</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.502" end="00:18:24.303" style="s2">Elena, with me, you don&#39;t need to hold</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.377" end="00:18:27.303" style="s2">[music] back for anyone. My wife should</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.303" end="00:18:27.303" style="s2">get to enjoy everything.</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.617" end="00:18:31.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.203" end="00:18:35.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This much effort.</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.303" end="00:18:35.503" style="s2">So tonight, is that what this is?</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.803" end="00:18:46.012" style="s2">Alexander,</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.603" end="00:18:46.012" style="s2">I&#39;m ready. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.703" end="00:18:54.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, relax. [music] I just remembered</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.103" end="00:18:55.703" style="s2">I&#39;ve got a few calls to take in the</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.303" end="00:18:56.203" style="s2">study. I&#39;ll sleep in the guest room</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.703" end="00:18:56.803" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.203" end="00:18:58.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.803" end="00:18:59.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Trust takes time, Elena. I want your</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.703" end="00:19:03.403" style="s2">heart.</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.903" end="00:19:03.403" style="s2">I&#39;ll wait [music] until you&#39;re ready.</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.503" end="00:19:08.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This feeling, being cared [music] for</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.503" end="00:19:12.803" style="s2">like this,</p>
<p begin="00:19:08.803" end="00:19:12.803" style="s2">it means more than the wedding ever did.</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.303" end="00:19:17.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, thank God you finally picked up.</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.503" end="00:19:18.303" style="s2">Are you safe?</p>
<p begin="00:19:17.303" end="00:19:20.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father&#39;s been showing up at the</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.303" end="00:19:21.603" style="s2">workshop with lawyers trying to force me</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.203" end="00:19:23.803" style="s2">to tell him where you are.</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.603" end="00:19:24.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle, I&#39;m safe. I&#39;m somewhere he can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.803" end="00:19:25.803" style="s2">reach me.</p>
<p begin="00:19:24.603" end="00:19:27.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s all that matters. I should have</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.803" end="00:19:29.303" style="s2">protected you better. The Blackwoods</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.403" end="00:19:30.403" style="s2">only care about profit, and I couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:19:29.303" end="00:19:31.703" style="s2">even protect my own niece.</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.403" end="00:19:32.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You already gave me the best protection</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.703" end="00:19:33.303" style="s2">there is.</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.303" end="00:19:34.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, Elena, there&#39;s something else. You</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.303" end="00:19:36.003" style="s2">won&#39;t believe this. An anonymous</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.403" end="00:19:37.303" style="s2">investment firm just wired $5 million</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.003" end="00:19:38.303" style="s2">into the workshop. They even pulled</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.303" end="00:19:40.003" style="s2">strings and secured me the main</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.303" end="00:19:40.903" style="s2">exhibition spot for Onyx Port Art Week.</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.003" end="00:19:42.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anonymous?</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.903" end="00:19:43.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, said they believed in my</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.203" end="00:19:45.103" style="s2">craftsmanship.</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.203" end="00:19:45.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, is our luck finally turning</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.103" end="00:19:47.103" style="s2">around?</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.503" end="00:19:49.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex, no one else could step in</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.103" end="00:19:50.303" style="s2">precisely this quietly. That&#39;s amazing</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.503" end="00:19:51.503" style="s2">news.</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.303" end="00:19:53.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take care of yourself. I&#39;m going to hang</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.503" end="00:19:53.703" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.903" end="00:19:56.703" style="s2">Elena,</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.003" end="00:19:58.003" style="s2">I&#39;m in the hospital. Happy now? Seeing</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.703" end="00:19:59.103" style="s2">me like this, does it feel good?</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.003" end="00:20:00.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian, wasn&#39;t this your little</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.103" end="00:20:02.303" style="s2">loyalty test? You play games with</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.703" end="00:20:03.203" style="s2">people&#39;s hearts. Don&#39;t act surprised</p>
<p begin="00:20:02.303" end="00:20:04.903" style="s2">when it blows back on you.</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.203" end="00:20:06.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. We had 10 years together, and</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.903" end="00:20:07.803" style="s2">you just humiliated me like that.</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.203" end="00:20:09.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You staged the whole thing, faked</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.803" end="00:20:11.503" style="s2">amnesia just to test me and handed your</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.903" end="00:20:13.403" style="s2">bastard daughter the spotlight.</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.503" end="00:20:14.303" style="s2">Sebastian, those 10 years were just your</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.403" end="00:20:16.003" style="s2">own delusion.</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.303" end="00:20:17.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just come back. Make a statement. Say</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.003" end="00:20:19.403" style="s2">the wedding was all a misunderstanding.</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.403" end="00:20:20.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll let everything go. Elena, no one</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.403" end="00:20:22.003" style="s2">loves you more than I</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.303" end="00:20:24.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The second you decided to use me, you</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.003" end="00:20:25.805" style="s2">were dead to me. Right now, you don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.305" end="00:20:28.305" style="s2">even make it onto my list of things to</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.805" end="00:20:28.305" style="s2">remember.</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.405" end="00:20:46.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena.</p>
<p begin="00:20:43.705" end="00:20:49.305" style="s2"> you&#39;re gone. So why are you still</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.605" end="00:20:49.305" style="s2">in his head?</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.905" end="00:20:58.705" style="s2">Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.205" end="00:20:58.705" style="s2">I need you to take care of something.</p>
<p begin="00:21:00.234" end="00:21:03.405" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.905" end="00:21:05.305" style="s2">Uncle, I was just about to</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.405" end="00:21:07.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all gone. The warehouse caught</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.305" end="00:21:09.705" style="s2">fire. The new shipment, the imported</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.505" end="00:21:11.369" style="s2">stones, that was everything. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.705" end="00:21:12.905" style="s2">It&#39;s all ash now.</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.369" end="00:21:14.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.905" end="00:21:17.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle, don&#39;t panic. I&#39;ll figure</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.805" end="00:21:17.305" style="s2">something out.</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.574" end="00:21:20.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:23.705" end="00:21:27.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, [music] where the hell have you</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.605" end="00:21:30.205" style="s2">been? Do you have any idea how badly the</p>
<p begin="00:21:27.705" end="00:21:30.805" style="s2">Kingsleys are treating us right now?</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.205" end="00:21:33.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not now.</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.805" end="00:21:35.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not now? Blackwood Realty is about to go</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.405" end="00:21:38.405" style="s2">under. You get back here now and make a</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.905" end="00:21:40.205" style="s2">public apology. Say the wedding fiasco</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.405" end="00:21:43.705" style="s2">was all your fault. That&#39;s the only way</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.205" end="00:21:43.705" style="s2">to fix this with the Kingsleys.</p>
<p begin="00:21:51.605" end="00:21:55.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got you.</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.005" end="00:21:55.705" style="s2">Don&#39;t be afraid.</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.910" end="00:21:57.930" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:22:12.805" end="00:22:16.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex,</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.105" end="00:22:19.005" style="s2">my uncle&#39;s warehouse. I have to figure</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.305" end="00:22:19.005" style="s2">something out.</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.305" end="00:22:23.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got the rest. On this island,</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.205" end="00:22:25.705" style="s2">nothing gets out of control, not on my</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.105" end="00:22:25.705" style="s2">watch.</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.406" end="00:22:31.506" style="s2">Drink.</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.906" end="00:22:31.506" style="s2">Then go to bed.</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.006" end="00:22:43.006" style="s2">Dominic, listen carefully. Shut down</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.506" end="00:22:45.006" style="s2">every external funding line tied to</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.006" end="00:22:46.606" style="s2">Blackwood Realty, banks, private equity,</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.006" end="00:22:48.965" style="s2">all of it. I want them watching their</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.606" end="00:22:50.906" style="s2">empire crumble within 3 [music] days.</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.965" end="00:22:53.506" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.906" end="00:22:53.506" style="s2">Did I wake you up?</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.906" end="00:22:59.806" style="s2">We traced the fire. Masked IP, but the</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.206" end="00:23:01.806" style="s2">physical signal came from near Blackwood</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.806" end="00:23:03.106" style="s2">Group HQ. Your father [music] or your</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.806" end="00:23:04.606" style="s2">stepdaughter.</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.106" end="00:23:07.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Doesn&#39;t matter, Alexander.</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.606" end="00:23:08.806" style="s2">Prison&#39;s too easy. I want them to watch</p>
<p begin="00:23:07.006" end="00:23:10.906" style="s2">everything they care about, power,</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.806" end="00:23:12.806" style="s2">status, money,</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.906" end="00:23:14.706" style="s2">burn to the ground</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.806" end="00:23:16.006" style="s2">piece by piece, just like my uncle&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.706" end="00:23:18.006" style="s2">warehouse.</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.006" end="00:23:18.906" style="s2">I want them [music] on their knees</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.006" end="00:23:20.806" style="s2">begging me.</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.906" end="00:23:23.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your call, Mrs. St. Clair.</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.806" end="00:23:23.706" style="s2">The hunt [music] starts now.</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.106" end="00:23:27.906" style="s2">Everything&#39;s moving as planned, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.506" end="00:23:28.806" style="s2">We&#39;ve sent proof of Blackwood Realty&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:23:27.906" end="00:23:30.506" style="s2">illegal fund raising to all their</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.806" end="00:23:32.206" style="s2">partner banks. Risk reviews are already</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.506" end="00:23:33.606" style="s2">underway.</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.206" end="00:23:35.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The trust fund he squimmed?</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.606" end="00:23:36.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Confirmed. Charles has been siphoning</p>
<p begin="00:23:35.106" end="00:23:38.306" style="s2">from Ms. Diana&#39;s trust for years, about</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.806" end="00:23:40.006" style="s2">30 million. We&#39;ve packaged the evidence</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.306" end="00:23:42.406" style="s2">and sent it to several key shareholders.</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.006" end="00:23:45.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. He likes taking what isn&#39;t his.</p>
<p begin="00:23:42.406" end="00:23:48.906" style="s2">Now he pays it back every cent.</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.906" end="00:23:50.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who the hell is behind this?</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.906" end="00:23:51.706" style="s2">Sir, this is bad. Three more major</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.406" end="00:23:53.106" style="s2">shareholders just pulled their money.</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.706" end="00:23:55.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pulled out? Are they insane?</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.106" end="00:23:56.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s more. Wells Fargo City, multiple</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.006" end="00:23:57.906" style="s2">banks just called in their loans. They</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.106" end="00:23:59.051" style="s2">want full repayment within 24 hours or</p>
<p begin="00:23:57.906" end="00:24:01.071" style="s2">they&#39;ll start seizing assets.</p>
<p begin="00:23:59.051" end="00:24:01.071" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.206" end="00:24:16.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, the bank froze all my cards. I</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.606" end="00:24:18.006" style="s2">can&#39;t even fill up the Ferrari. How much</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.606" end="00:24:19.906" style="s2">can we get for these?</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.006" end="00:24:22.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop screaming. Pick the pieces that</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.906" end="00:24:22.606" style="s2">will move fast.</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.806" end="00:24:25.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, you finally decided to call me</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.606" end="00:24:27.906" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.506" end="00:24:30.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow night, 7 o&#39;clock.</p>
<p begin="00:24:27.906" end="00:24:30.406" style="s2">I want everyone there. We need to talk.</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.207" end="00:24:30.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Talk?</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.406" end="00:24:32.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.908" end="00:24:33.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; yes, of course. I knew you still cared</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.507" end="00:24:35.408" style="s2">about this family. Just come back and</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.908" end="00:24:36.707" style="s2">apologize. I&#39;ll smooth things over with</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.408" end="00:24:38.408" style="s2">the Kingslands.</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.707" end="00:24:39.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Make sure Catherine and Isabella are</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.408" end="00:24:41.007" style="s2">there.</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.507" end="00:24:44.007" style="s2">we&#39;re doing this,</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.007" end="00:24:44.007" style="s2">we settle it properly.</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.107" end="00:24:49.707" style="s2">We just need to get through a few days.</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.707" end="00:24:49.707" style="s2">Once your father gets the money</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.007" end="00:24:54.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena just called. She&#39;s coming back</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.107" end="00:24:55.107" style="s2">tomorrow night, wants to sit down and</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.107" end="00:24:56.707" style="s2">talk.</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.107" end="00:24:58.657" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew it. She wouldn&#39;t last. Without</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.707" end="00:25:00.507" style="s2">the Blackwoods, she&#39;s nothing. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.657" end="00:25:01.307" style="s2">[music] scared. Coming back to beg us to</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.507" end="00:25:03.207" style="s2">take her in?</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.307" end="00:25:05.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Smart girl. Tomorrow night, I&#39;ll have</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.207" end="00:25:08.408" style="s2">her on her knees, begging for what she</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.408" end="00:25:08.408" style="s2">pulled at that wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.807" end="00:25:14.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, when she drops to her knees and</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.607" end="00:25:17.807" style="s2">begs, I&#39;m filming it. Every socialite in</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.807" end="00:25:17.807" style="s2">the city is going to see it.</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.007" end="00:25:27.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena!</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.707" end="00:25:29.107" style="s2">What is this supposed to be? You bring</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.107" end="00:25:32.307" style="s2">outsiders into my home? This your idea</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.107" end="00:25:32.307" style="s2">of making things right?</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.707" end="00:25:36.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Making things right?</p>
<p begin="00:25:34.507" end="00:25:38.807" style="s2">Dad, you really believe that?</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.707" end="00:25:41.007" style="s2">Take a good look. That&#39;s every record of</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.807" end="00:25:42.908" style="s2">you draining my mother&#39;s trust and a</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.007" end="00:25:45.607" style="s2">full paper trail tying Catherine and her</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.908" end="00:25:46.507" style="s2">daughter to the fire. All verified, all</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.607" end="00:25:49.107" style="s2">real.</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.507" end="00:25:50.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is a setup. You&#39;re insane. You</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.107" end="00:25:52.107" style="s2">fabricated all of this.</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.707" end="00:25:54.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Catherine, all evidence has been</p>
<p begin="00:25:52.107" end="00:25:56.307" style="s2">notarized. It supports charges of arson</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.507" end="00:25:58.607" style="s2">and embezzlement. You&#39;re facing prison</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.307" end="00:26:01.007" style="s2">time along with civil damages. All</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.607" end="00:26:02.007" style="s2">related assets have already been frozen.</p>
<p begin="00:26:01.007" end="00:26:04.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sign.</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.007" end="00:26:07.307" style="s2">Return my mother&#39;s 10% dowry shares and</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.207" end="00:26:09.207" style="s2">my 15% inheritance. Sign and we&#39;ll file</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.307" end="00:26:11.507" style="s2">for leniency. Don&#39;t. And this goes</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.207" end="00:26:13.207" style="s2">straight to court.</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.507" end="00:26:15.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve lost it. YOU&#39;RE GOING TO RUIN</p>
<p begin="00:26:13.207" end="00:26:16.908" style="s2">THIS FAMILY.</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.307" end="00:26:20.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;d really do this to me?</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.908" end="00:26:20.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sign or go to prison.</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.807" end="00:26:30.507" style="s2">We&#39;re done here.</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.809" end="00:26:49.353" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.309" end="00:26:49.709" style="s2">I got it back.</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.353" end="00:26:51.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.709" end="00:26:53.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want to be</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.409" end="00:26:53.509" style="s2">alone.</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.709" end="00:27:01.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it all back?</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.709" end="00:27:02.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With your help, yeah. Everything&#39;s back</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.309" end="00:27:03.709" style="s2">where it belongs.</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.209" end="00:27:05.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. I booked the top floor at Lower</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.709" end="00:27:06.509" style="s2">Spire. No business tonight. Just us.</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.709" end="00:27:08.309" style="s2">We&#39;re celebrating.</p>
<p begin="00:27:06.509" end="00:27:09.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were that sure I&#39;d pull it off?</p>
<p begin="00:27:08.309" end="00:27:12.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re my Mrs. St. Clair. Get home</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.709" end="00:27:12.609" style="s2">early. I&#39;ll be waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.309" end="00:27:19.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian,</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.909" end="00:27:20.909" style="s2">the hotel manager found this in Elena&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.709" end="00:27:22.809" style="s2">room.</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.909" end="00:27:24.309" style="s2">Her old phone. You should take a look.</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.809" end="00:27:27.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A phone?</p>
<p begin="00:27:24.309" end="00:27:27.409" style="s2">What&#39;s that supposed to prove?</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.509" end="00:27:35.209" style="s2">That psycho. She sent all this behind my</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.809" end="00:27:35.209" style="s2">back?</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.209" end="00:27:48.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She knew.</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.709" end="00:27:50.709" style="s2">She knew all of it.</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.509" end="00:27:52.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You kept calling it a test.</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.709" end="00:27:54.509" style="s2">But real love doesn&#39;t work like that.</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.409" end="00:27:57.474" style="s2">You pushed her away yourself. You broke</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.509" end="00:27:58.709" style="s2">the last bit of trust she had in you.</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.474" end="00:28:01.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.709" end="00:28:03.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena.</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.009" end="00:28:05.709" style="s2">What did I do?</p>
<p begin="00:28:03.609" end="00:28:09.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian,</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.709" end="00:28:09.009" style="s2">I brought your favorite soup.</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.309" end="00:28:16.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out. You&#39;re insane.</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.709" end="00:28:18.109" style="s2">You really thought those pathetic emails</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.609" end="00:28:20.809" style="s2">would stay hidden forever?</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.109" end="00:28:22.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian, I love you. I stayed by your</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.809" end="00:28:23.909" style="s2">side. I was even willing to live in her</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.209" end="00:28:25.409" style="s2">shadow. Why is she the only one you ever</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.909" end="00:28:27.309" style="s2">care about?</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.409" end="00:28:30.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Love me? You&#39;re all calculation. You</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.309" end="00:28:31.109" style="s2">don&#39;t even come close to Elena.</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.109" end="00:28:33.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow.</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.109" end="00:28:35.110" style="s2">Not even close? [music] Sebastian, who</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.309" end="00:28:37.310" style="s2">are you trying to fool?</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.110" end="00:28:39.310" style="s2">You faked amnesia just to test her? You</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.310" end="00:28:41.410" style="s2">stood there and watched me humiliate</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.310" end="00:28:44.110" style="s2">her. Wasn&#39;t that you? You&#39;re the one who</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.410" end="00:28:44.110" style="s2">destroyed her.</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.510" end="00:28:51.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me see her.</p>
<p begin="00:28:50.110" end="00:28:53.210" style="s2">Chloe, I know I screwed up. I need to</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.510" end="00:28:55.210" style="s2">explain. I have to tell her myself.</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.210" end="00:28:57.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Explain what? How you sucked 10 years</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.210" end="00:28:57.810" style="s2">out of her life?</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.810" end="00:29:07.010" style="s2">Take it, all of it.</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.510" end="00:29:10.710" style="s2">She didn&#39;t shed a single tear when she</p>
<p begin="00:29:07.010" end="00:29:10.710" style="s2">left. She finally woke up from you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.410" end="00:29:28.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She blocked me. Elena,</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.710" end="00:29:29.175" style="s2">I really lost you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.210" end="00:29:30.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.175" end="00:29:33.610" style="s2">[laughter and gasps] Sebastian&#39;s gone</p>
<p begin="00:29:30.410" end="00:29:35.110" style="s2">insane. He actually hit me. He&#39;s turning</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.610" end="00:29:36.510" style="s2">on me over that</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.110" end="00:29:38.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please.</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.510" end="00:29:40.810" style="s2">The Kingsleys think they can use us and</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.310" end="00:29:42.410" style="s2">walk away? Not a chance. I&#39;m calling</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.810" end="00:29:44.110" style="s2">Eleanor. If they don&#39;t give me an</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.410" end="00:29:46.210" style="s2">answer, I&#39;ll take this straight to Port</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.110" end="00:29:47.810" style="s2">Chronicle.</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.210" end="00:29:49.710" style="s2">Eleanor, I&#39;m sure you don&#39;t want</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.810" end="00:29:51.510" style="s2">Kingsley heir attacks fiance sprayed</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.710" end="00:29:52.410" style="s2">across the society poaches tomorrow, do</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.510" end="00:29:54.410" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:29:52.410" end="00:29:56.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, the Kingsleys are pulling strings</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.410" end="00:29:56.910" style="s2">to suppress the story about Isabella&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.010" end="00:29:58.410" style="s2">injury.</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.910" end="00:29:59.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Suppress it?</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.410" end="00:30:01.210" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:29:59.310" end="00:30:02.910" style="s2">I want it everywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.210" end="00:30:04.010" style="s2">Call every major outlet. You know the</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.910" end="00:30:06.310" style="s2">play.</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.010" end="00:30:06.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.710" end="00:30:11.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, Alexander Sinclair. Figured you&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.910" end="00:30:13.610" style="s2">want a heads up. Your grandson Sebastian</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.710" end="00:30:15.010" style="s2">just sparked a scandal in Anic Port.</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.610" end="00:30:16.510" style="s2">Regulators are already eyeing the</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.010" end="00:30:18.610" style="s2">Kingsley Trust. If you don&#39;t want the</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.510" end="00:30:22.010" style="s2">stock cut in half at market open,</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.610" end="00:30:22.010" style="s2">make your move now.</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.540" end="00:30:25.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.710" end="00:30:36.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absolute idiot. LOOK AT THIS MESS. HQ&#39;S</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.510" end="00:30:38.012" style="s2">ALREADY TRIGGERED EMERGENCY PROTOCOLS.</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.610" end="00:30:39.912" style="s2">If I want to keep my seat on that board,</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.012" end="00:30:41.412" style="s2">I have to act publicly.</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.912" end="00:30:42.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, it&#39;s not what it looks like.</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.412" end="00:30:43.912" style="s2">Isabella set me up. She sent those</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.712" end="00:30:45.912" style="s2">emails to Elena first.</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.912" end="00:30:48.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; it. Effective immediately, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.912" end="00:30:49.812" style="s2">suspended from all family roles. All</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.412" end="00:30:52.112" style="s2">your trust accounts are frozen. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.812" end="00:30:54.212" style="s2">out of the Kingsley building.</p>
<p begin="00:30:52.112" end="00:30:57.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So this is what it feels like</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.212" end="00:30:57.112" style="s2">to lose everything.</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.612" end="00:31:05.712" style="s2">This.</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.312" end="00:31:08.212" style="s2">It&#39;s the same as that little place on</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.712" end="00:31:11.412" style="s2">the Left Bank in Paris.</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.212" end="00:31:12.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You wrote about it in your study journal</p>
<p begin="00:31:11.412" end="00:31:15.112" style="s2">that it was the one taste you never</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.712" end="00:31:15.112" style="s2">forgot.</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.712" end="00:31:19.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian always said this kind of thing</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.212" end="00:31:22.912" style="s2">was a waste of time. He only took me to</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.512" end="00:31:22.912" style="s2">the dinners he needed for business.</p>
<p begin="00:31:23.712" end="00:31:27.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, you don&#39;t have to adjust yourself</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.212" end="00:31:29.212" style="s2">for anyone anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.012" end="00:31:30.512" style="s2">Sinclair Capital, the entire Spire</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.212" end="00:31:34.012" style="s2">district,</p>
<p begin="00:31:30.512" end="00:31:34.012" style="s2">it&#39;s yours to build whatever you want.</p>
<p begin="00:31:43.112" end="00:31:46.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I painted this anaphrene when I was</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.712" end="00:31:47.612" style="s2">younger.</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.312" end="00:31:49.112" style="s2">How did it end up here?</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.612" end="00:31:50.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Over the years,</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.112" end="00:31:52.212" style="s2">I tracked down everything you had to</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.712" end="00:31:54.212" style="s2">give up.</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.212" end="00:31:56.912" style="s2">Every piece you lost, I found it and</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.212" end="00:31:56.912" style="s2">brought it back.</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.712" end="00:32:07.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, everything you asked for is ready.</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.212" end="00:32:15.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These,</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.412" end="00:32:17.812" style="s2">they&#39;re my favorite.</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.712" end="00:32:20.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember what you love,</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.812" end="00:32:21.912" style="s2">and I remember every dream you ever had.</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.212" end="00:32:23.312" style="s2">With me, you&#39;ll never have to feel small</p>
<p begin="00:32:21.912" end="00:32:26.012" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.312" end="00:32:28.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So beneath that cold, ruthless exterior,</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.012" end="00:32:30.012" style="s2">there&#39;s a heart that beats just for me.</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.612" end="00:32:32.512" style="s2">I think</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.012" end="00:32:33.912" style="s2">I&#39;m really falling for him.</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.512" end="00:32:36.812" style="s2">The structure&#39;s off.</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.912" end="00:32:38.512" style="s2">The base won&#39;t hold the center stone.</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.812" end="00:32:39.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Try a triangular support. Shift the load</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.512" end="00:32:41.113" style="s2">to the side wings.</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.313" end="00:32:42.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That works. It&#39;s stronger and cleaner.</p>
<p begin="00:32:41.113" end="00:32:43.113" style="s2">Alex, since when do you know structural</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.513" end="00:32:44.513" style="s2">design?</p>
<p begin="00:32:43.113" end="00:32:45.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know more than structure. I know you</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.513" end="00:32:46.913" style="s2">turned down a full scholarship to</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.513" end="00:32:49.813" style="s2">Silverpoise Design School.</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.913" end="00:32:50.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian, I got in. I can go really go</p>
<p begin="00:32:49.813" end="00:32:52.613" style="s2">study design.</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.813" end="00:32:54.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, you know my parents don&#39;t like</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.613" end="00:32:56.913" style="s2">women who are too career driven.</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.713" end="00:32:58.913" style="s2">Be good. Stay with me. Focus on being</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.913" end="00:33:00.913" style="s2">Mrs. Kingsley L. Don&#39;t chase things that</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.913" end="00:33:03.113" style="s2">don&#39;t matter.</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.913" end="00:33:04.913" style="s2">With Sebastian, you were always thinking</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.113" end="00:33:07.513" style="s2">about what he wanted. What about you?</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.913" end="00:33:09.513" style="s2">What do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.513" end="00:33:10.913" style="s2">Real love pushes you to shine. It</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.513" end="00:33:12.113" style="s2">doesn&#39;t lock you in a cage and put you</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.913" end="00:33:13.213" style="s2">on display.</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.113" end="00:33:14.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.213" end="00:33:16.113" style="s2">sacrifice meant love.</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.513" end="00:33:17.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That wasn&#39;t love.</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.113" end="00:33:19.913" style="s2">That was control. I&#39;ve already put a</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.813" end="00:33:23.513" style="s2">team together for you. Elena, you&#39;re too</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.913" end="00:33:23.513" style="s2">talented to be dimmed by anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.613" end="00:33:28.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Alex. I&#39;m in.</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.713" end="00:33:30.913" style="s2">I won&#39;t let you down.</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.213" end="00:33:32.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t owe me anything.</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.913" end="00:33:35.513" style="s2">Elena,</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.313" end="00:33:35.513" style="s2">just don&#39;t let yourself down.</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.213" end="00:33:46.013" style="s2">Ready?</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.213" end="00:33:47.413" style="s2">I&#39;ve got someone I want you to see.</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.013" end="00:33:49.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s this?</p>
<p begin="00:33:47.413" end="00:33:51.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A secret that&#39;s been sitting untouched</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.713" end="00:33:53.013" style="s2">for 10 years.</p>
<p begin="00:33:51.813" end="00:33:56.513" style="s2">And where</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.013" end="00:33:56.513" style="s2">you start taking everything back.</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.513" end="00:34:10.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is my mom&#39;s studio.</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.613" end="00:34:10.313" style="s2">Alex, how did you find it?</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.513" end="00:34:14.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Diana? No.</p>
<p begin="00:34:13.013" end="00:34:15.513" style="s2">Elena?</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.113" end="00:34:17.613" style="s2">You&#39;re her spitting image.</p>
<p begin="00:34:15.513" end="00:34:19.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Pierre, Mr. Hans, Ms. Sarah, I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:34:17.613" end="00:34:23.913" style="s2">seen your photos in my mom&#39;s journal.</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.713" end="00:34:23.913" style="s2">Thank you for staying all these years.</p>
<p begin="00:34:26.548" end="00:34:28.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.413" end="00:34:30.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After your mother passed, I kept this</p>
<p begin="00:34:28.913" end="00:34:31.713" style="s2">place running</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.313" end="00:34:33.513" style="s2">quietly,</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.713" end="00:34:35.513" style="s2">protected them too.</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.513" end="00:34:37.813" style="s2">10 years just waiting for you to come</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.513" end="00:34:37.813" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.714" end="00:34:50.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all yours now, Elena.</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.314" end="00:34:52.814" style="s2">Go build something that&#39;s yours.</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.814" end="00:34:54.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know what I want to do. I&#39;m carving</p>
<p begin="00:34:52.814" end="00:34:55.014" style="s2">our studio&#39;s name into the base of this</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.314" end="00:34:56.414" style="s2">stone.</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.014" end="00:34:57.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, yeah? What&#39;s the name?</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.414" end="00:34:58.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aura.</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.314" end="00:35:01.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aura?</p>
<p begin="00:34:58.114" end="00:35:01.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because you&#39;re the light that found me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.914" end="00:35:15.714" style="s2">Pierre, I&#39;m not re-cutting it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.314" end="00:35:17.414" style="s2">I want to do a gold vein setting, 24k</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.714" end="00:35:20.314" style="s2">gold to reconnect the fractures.</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.414" end="00:35:21.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like repairing antique porcelain? That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.314" end="00:35:24.214" style="s2">dangerously bold, kid.</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.814" end="00:35:25.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That takes insane precision.</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.214" end="00:35:27.014" style="s2">One slip</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.514" end="00:35:29.114" style="s2">and the stone&#39;s gone.</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.014" end="00:35:31.414" style="s2">Broken doesn&#39;t mean ruined.</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.114" end="00:35:34.314" style="s2">I want these cracks to shine</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.414" end="00:35:36.214" style="s2">like badges of honor.</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.314" end="00:35:39.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If this is your first creation,</p>
<p begin="00:35:36.214" end="00:35:39.514" style="s2">I want to be your first client.</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.414" end="00:35:44.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, this is just a common river rock.</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.214" end="00:35:46.214" style="s2">Low density, fragile texture. If we use</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.614" end="00:35:46.814" style="s2">that gold vein method, it won&#39;t survive</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.214" end="00:35:48.214" style="s2">the heat.</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.814" end="00:35:50.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This stone.</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.214" end="00:35:53.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t chase the physical copy. Capture</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.414" end="00:35:54.914" style="s2">its soul. Get the feeling right. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.114" end="00:35:56.114" style="s2">obsess over the shape.</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.914" end="00:35:59.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.114" end="00:35:59.014" style="s2">I &#39;ve got an idea.</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.614" end="00:36:16.214" style="s2">It&#39;s yours.</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.814" end="00:36:20.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 20 years.</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.214" end="00:36:22.114" style="s2">I finally found my girl.</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.614" end="00:36:25.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.114" end="00:36:29.214" style="s2">This stone, this handkerchief, it feels</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.514" end="00:36:29.214" style="s2">like we&#39;ve met somewhere long ago.</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.114" end="00:36:44.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t look at them. Look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.014" end="00:36:47.516" style="s2">Today,</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.414" end="00:36:47.516" style="s2">you&#39;re the only queen in this room.</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.616" end="00:36:59.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t that the runaway Kingsley bride?</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.516" end="00:37:00.716" style="s2">Heard her wedding was a disaster. Didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.316" end="00:37:01.916" style="s2">expect her to land with a Sinclair so</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.716" end="00:37:03.316" style="s2">fast.</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.916" end="00:37:04.916" style="s2">That woman plays a long game.</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.316" end="00:37:07.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What could a girl from her background</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.916" end="00:37:10.116" style="s2">know about fine jewelry? Probably riding</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.016" end="00:37:10.116" style="s2">a man&#39;s coattails.</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.816" end="00:37:20.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And now, the main exhibit.</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.716" end="00:37:26.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brilliant.</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.216" end="00:37:28.716" style="s2">Using gold veins to hold a shattered</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.616" end="00:37:30.616" style="s2">soul. In 40 years, I&#39;ve never seen such</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.716" end="00:37:32.916" style="s2">daring and vision.</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.616" end="00:37:35.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Many think broken means the end. I</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.916" end="00:37:36.916" style="s2">believe divinity emerges from what&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.016" end="00:37:39.316" style="s2">broken. This brooch is called the</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.916" end="00:37:42.416" style="s2">resurgence. It marks the final farewell</p>
<p begin="00:37:39.316" end="00:37:42.916" style="s2">to corruption and all that space.</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.416" end="00:37:45.216" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.916" end="00:37:47.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Many think broken means the end. I</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.216" end="00:37:48.216" style="s2">believe divinity emerges from what&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:37:47.316" end="00:37:51.116" style="s2">broken.</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.216" end="00:37:51.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did I lose?</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.816" end="00:37:57.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena,</p>
<p begin="00:37:55.816" end="00:37:59.916" style="s2">I finally see Isabella for what she</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.316" end="00:38:01.416" style="s2">really is. She&#39;s insane.</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.916" end="00:38:03.116" style="s2">For 10 years, just give me one more</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.416" end="00:38:04.416" style="s2">chance.</p>
<p begin="00:38:03.116" end="00:38:06.016" style="s2">Come back to me,</p>
<p begin="00:38:04.416" end="00:38:07.716" style="s2">and I&#39;ll make it clear. You&#39;re the only</p>
<p begin="00:38:06.016" end="00:38:10.116" style="s2">Mrs. Kingsley.</p>
<p begin="00:38:07.716" end="00:38:12.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10 years? Sebastian, did you even think</p>
<p begin="00:38:10.116" end="00:38:14.016" style="s2">about 10 years when Isabella smashed my</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.016" end="00:38:15.916" style="s2">mother&#39;s legacy? Or when you were</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.016" end="00:38:16.816" style="s2">parading with her, did you think about</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.916" end="00:38:19.216" style="s2">10 years?</p>
<p begin="00:38:16.816" end="00:38:19.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.116" end="00:38:22.416" style="s2">Don&#39;t think I don&#39;t know about your new</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.416" end="00:38:24.216" style="s2">guy.</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.416" end="00:38:26.216" style="s2">You act all tough because of him.</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.216" end="00:38:29.316" style="s2">Without him, you&#39;re still just the girl</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.216" end="00:38:33.216" style="s2">the Blackwood&#39;s tossed aside.</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.316" end="00:38:33.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Some things never change, Sebastian.</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.816" end="00:38:39.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like this room could use some</p>
<p begin="00:38:38.316" end="00:38:40.216" style="s2">fresh air.</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.316" end="00:38:42.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You?</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.216" end="00:38:44.716" style="s2">The man from the launch livestream.</p>
<p begin="00:38:42.816" end="00:38:46.117" style="s2">I knew it. Don&#39;t get cocky. You have no</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.716" end="00:38:46.417" style="s2">idea the schemes this woman&#39;s is capable</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.117" end="00:38:48.917" style="s2">of.</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.417" end="00:38:50.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How&#39;s it feel? Losing every family</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.917" end="00:38:54.317" style="s2">position and having all your trusts</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.917" end="00:38:55.417" style="s2">frozen? Not so fun, is it?</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.317" end="00:38:57.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How does he know?</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.417" end="00:39:00.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before I decide to clean Obsidian Island</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.817" end="00:39:03.617" style="s2">of all its trash.</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.417" end="00:39:03.617" style="s2">Get out of my sight.</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.167" end="00:39:14.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.317" end="00:39:14.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Alex.</p>
<p begin="00:39:14.817" end="00:39:20.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Trash is cleared. Now</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.617" end="00:39:20.917" style="s2">try the pastries you love.</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.717" end="00:39:32.717" style="s2">Let&#39;s see</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.217" end="00:39:36.717" style="s2">what kind of investor could make a</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.717" end="00:39:36.717" style="s2">nobody like you rise overnight.</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.217" end="00:39:46.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sinclair Manor?</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.417" end="00:39:47.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That exiled bastard Alexander Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.017" end="00:39:49.417" style="s2">bought the priciest land on Obsidian</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.717" end="00:39:50.717" style="s2">Island. Even the Kingsleys don&#39;t dare</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.417" end="00:39:51.817" style="s2">touch it.</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.717" end="00:39:54.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.817" end="00:39:57.217" style="s2">Impossible. Alexander?</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.517" end="00:40:01.317" style="s2">My uncle?</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.217" end="00:40:04.517" style="s2">ELENA, COME OUT! YOU TRAITOR!</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.317" end="00:40:07.217" style="s2">HOW DARE YOU BETRAY ME? I WANT ANSWERS!</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.517" end="00:40:09.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MR. KINGSLEY, this is private property.</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.217" end="00:40:11.617" style="s2">Leave now or we&#39;ll take action.</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.217" end="00:40:14.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MOVE, YOU LAPDOGS! Tell Alexander he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.617" end="00:40:17.617" style="s2">no right to take WHAT&#39;S MINE. SHAMELESS!</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.117" end="00:40:17.617" style="s2">CONSPIRING WITH THEM AGAINST ME!</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.217" end="00:40:23.917" style="s2">DAD, it&#39;s bad.</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.417" end="00:40:25.917" style="s2">Elena, she&#39;s with Alexander. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:40:23.917" end="00:40:28.717" style="s2">humiliating me. You have TO FIX THIS.</p>
<p begin="00:40:25.917" end="00:40:28.717" style="s2">GET HER BACK.</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.117" end="00:40:34.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STOP STARING. You&#39;re just dirtying your</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.417" end="00:40:34.817" style="s2">eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.973" end="00:40:37.993" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.117" end="00:40:43.417" style="s2">Victor, control your son. If he comes</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.917" end="00:40:44.817" style="s2">within a mile of Elena again, I&#39;ll make</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.417" end="00:40:46.217" style="s2">the Kingsley trust disappear before the</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.817" end="00:40:47.917" style="s2">market opens tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.217" end="00:40:48.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander, he&#39;s young. It&#39;s just a</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.917" end="00:40:49.718" style="s2">misunderstanding.</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.717" end="00:40:51.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen carefully.</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.718" end="00:40:55.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena is the only lady of the Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.518" end="00:40:55.718" style="s2">family. Touch her, and you touch me.</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.118" end="00:41:00.918" style="s2">Don&#39;t be afraid.</p>
<p begin="00:40:59.518" end="00:41:02.828" style="s2">No one will ever intrude on your life</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.918" end="00:41:04.848" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.828" end="00:41:04.848" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.718" end="00:41:20.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You useless idiot. You&#39;re still out</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.118" end="00:41:21.618" style="s2">there causing trouble? Get your ass home</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.418" end="00:41:21.918" style="s2">now, or don&#39;t bother calling me your</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.618" end="00:41:23.518" style="s2">father.</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.918" end="00:41:24.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He stole my woman. He humiliated me in</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.518" end="00:41:25.318" style="s2">front of the entire harbor, and you want</p>
<p begin="00:41:24.618" end="00:41:26.418" style="s2">me to just hide?</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.318" end="00:41:27.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is your last warning. Stay the hell</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.418" end="00:41:28.518" style="s2">away from Alexanderson Cole. He&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.618" end="00:41:29.718" style="s2">lunatic. You want to drag this whole</p>
<p begin="00:41:28.518" end="00:41:32.618" style="s2">family down? When you say the word, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.718" end="00:41:32.618" style="s2">cut you off right now.</p>
<p begin="00:41:33.613" end="00:41:35.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.888" end="00:41:38.908" style="s2">[cheering]</p>
<p begin="00:41:40.018" end="00:41:43.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough, Sebastian. You&#39;re wasted.</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.018" end="00:41:45.218" style="s2">Elena&#39;s gone. Let it go.</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.718" end="00:41:47.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think I care about her? I can have</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.218" end="00:41:49.518" style="s2">any woman I want, but I&#39;m not swallowing</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.118" end="00:41:49.518" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.718" end="00:41:55.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t do this. You&#39;ll ruin yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.218" end="00:41:57.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; up, everyone in Akas Harbor, listen real</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.818" end="00:41:59.318" style="s2">good. Elena Blackwood, she&#39;s nothing but</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.718" end="00:42:01.018" style="s2">a gold digger who climbed into another</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.318" end="00:42:02.518" style="s2">man&#39;s bed for money. And Alexander,</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.018" end="00:42:04.118" style="s2">don&#39;t act like you&#39;re clean. You think a</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.518" end="00:42:06.018" style="s2">suit makes you a gentleman? You&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.118" end="00:42:08.718" style="s2">always be a nobody, a bastard no one</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.018" end="00:42:08.718" style="s2">ever wanted.</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.949" end="00:42:14.318" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.018" end="00:42:15.218" style="s2">Yeah, that&#39;s right. Let&#39;s all burn</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.318" end="00:42:16.818" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.218" end="00:42:18.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And Alexander, don&#39;t act like you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.818" end="00:42:20.418" style="s2">clean. You think a suit makes you a</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.318" end="00:42:23.718" style="s2">gentleman? You&#39;ll always be a nobody, a</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.418" end="00:42:23.718" style="s2">bastard no one ever wanted.</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.118" end="00:42:27.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir,</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.118" end="00:42:29.118" style="s2">the media already got the recording. The</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.618" end="00:42:30.518" style="s2">entire social scene on Obsidian Island</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.118" end="00:42:31.818" style="s2">is in chaos.</p>
<p begin="00:42:30.518" end="00:42:35.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like the Kingsleys don&#39;t care</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.818" end="00:42:35.118" style="s2">about their reputation anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:42:41.118" end="00:42:44.918" style="s2">Victor, I hear your son&#39;s been taking a</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.918" end="00:42:46.918" style="s2">real interest in my background.</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.918" end="00:42:48.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He was drunk, talking out of his ass.</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.918" end="00:42:50.218" style="s2">He&#39;s still your nephew. Cut him some</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.418" end="00:42:51.818" style="s2">slack for the family&#39;s [snorts] sake.</p>
<p begin="00:42:50.218" end="00:42:53.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nephew, funny.</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.818" end="00:42:55.320" style="s2">I don&#39;t remember any family calling me a</p>
<p begin="00:42:53.720" end="00:42:56.820" style="s2">bastard in public. I also hear you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:42:55.320" end="00:42:58.120" style="s2">going all in on that South American</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.820" end="00:42:59.420" style="s2">lithium deal. That&#39;s your only shot at</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.120" end="00:43:00.120" style="s2">getting back on the London board, isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.420" end="00:43:01.220" style="s2">it?</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.120" end="00:43:03.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do you know that?</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.220" end="00:43:06.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucky guess. I won in.</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.920" end="00:43:08.320" style="s2">If you still want that deal, two hours.</p>
<p begin="00:43:06.120" end="00:43:10.320" style="s2">Bring Sebastian to Sinclair Manor.</p>
<p begin="00:43:08.320" end="00:43:12.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want him at the Manor?</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.320" end="00:43:14.220" style="s2">Alexander, that&#39;s a bit</p>
<p begin="00:43:12.020" end="00:43:17.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just handed you the answer.</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.220" end="00:43:19.920" style="s2">Your son&#39;s pride or David&#39;s approval.</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.420" end="00:43:19.920" style="s2">Pick one.</p>
<p begin="00:43:22.999" end="00:43:25.019" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.120" end="00:43:31.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, what the hell? YOU AWAKE NOW?</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.920" end="00:43:33.020" style="s2">YOU IDIOT. DO YOU HAVE ANY IDEA WHAT</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.220" end="00:43:36.100" style="s2">YOU&#39;VE DONE? YOU ALMOST DRAGGED THE</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.020" end="00:43:36.820" style="s2">ENTIRE KINGSLY FAMILY DOWN WITH YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:43:36.100" end="00:43:37.920" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:43:36.820" end="00:43:41.320" style="s2">GET HIM UP.</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.920" end="00:43:41.320" style="s2">We&#39;re leaving. Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.720" end="00:43:48.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.720" end="00:43:49.220" style="s2">let go.</p>
<p begin="00:43:48.020" end="00:43:51.520" style="s2">I&#39;m not seeing her.</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.220" end="00:43:54.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up. If you don&#39;t kneel, we&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.520" end="00:43:54.820" style="s2">out on the street tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.020" end="00:44:05.420" style="s2">Mrs. Sinclair, my son is here to</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.220" end="00:44:05.420" style="s2">apologize. PLEASE SHOW HIM MERCY.</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.020" end="00:44:11.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DOMINIC,</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.320" end="00:44:12.020" style="s2">what&#39;s going on out there?</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.020" end="00:44:13.620" style="s2">Why all the noise?</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.020" end="00:44:15.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, the boss gave orders. Anyone</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.620" end="00:44:16.620" style="s2">who&#39;s humiliated you pays for it here.</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.220" end="00:44:17.420" style="s2">That&#39;s the Kingslys. They&#39;re here to</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.620" end="00:44:19.320" style="s2">apologize.</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.420" end="00:44:21.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really? No one told me.</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.320" end="00:44:23.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir said it wasn&#39;t worth bothering you.</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.720" end="00:44:25.020" style="s2">If you don&#39;t want to see them,</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.420" end="00:44:26.320" style="s2">I can have them removed immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.020" end="00:44:28.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.320" end="00:44:29.920" style="s2">If there&#39;s a show, I&#39;m watching it</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.320" end="00:44:32.420" style="s2">through to the end. I thought seeing him</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.920" end="00:44:34.220" style="s2">like this would feel like revenge,</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.420" end="00:44:36.820" style="s2">but it doesn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.220" end="00:44:36.820" style="s2">Just empty.</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.320" end="00:44:46.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, sweetheart, it&#39;s Dad. I heard</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.920" end="00:44:46.920" style="s2">that bastard Sebastian finally got what</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.020" end="00:44:48.020" style="s2">he deserved.</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.920" end="00:44:50.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.020" end="00:44:51.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, could you maybe talk to Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.120" end="00:44:54.220" style="s2">Alexander, see if he&#39;d consider</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.720" end="00:44:55.321" style="s2">investing in Blackwood Real Estate?</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.220" end="00:44:56.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me guess. Sebastian&#39;s done, so</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.321" end="00:45:00.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; now you want me to lash on to Alexander</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.821" end="00:45:00.621" style="s2">and keep funding your life? Wrong move.</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.121" end="00:45:03.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena,</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.121" end="00:45:04.621" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:45:03.521" end="00:45:07.021" style="s2">I was wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.621" end="00:45:09.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What, you forget how to speak? Louder, I</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.021" end="00:45:11.921" style="s2">want the whole manager to HEAR YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.921" end="00:45:12.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ELENA, I WAS WRONG. I&#39;M SORRY. PLEASE</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.921" end="00:45:14.421" style="s2">FORGIVE ME.</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.721" end="00:45:16.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ALEX, I don&#39;t feel like listening to</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.421" end="00:45:19.321" style="s2">cheap fake apologies anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.821" end="00:45:21.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what do you want to hear or better,</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.321" end="00:45:23.821" style="s2">what do you want to do?</p>
<p begin="00:45:21.821" end="00:45:25.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want roast pigeon from that place in</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.821" end="00:45:27.721" style="s2">Onet Harbor,</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.321" end="00:45:27.721" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.321" end="00:45:30.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Done.</p>
<p begin="00:45:39.241" end="00:45:43.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.121" end="00:45:46.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But he&#39;s still here, like a curse that</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.421" end="00:45:46.221" style="s2">won&#39;t let go.</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.621" end="00:46:07.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at that skin, soft as hell. And</p>
<p begin="00:46:05.821" end="00:46:09.221" style="s2">that Kingsley kid just left you here</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.321" end="00:46:10.921" style="s2">alone?</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.221" end="00:46:14.321" style="s2">Easy, sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.921" end="00:46:14.321" style="s2">We&#39;ll take good care of you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.321" end="00:46:20.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian,</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.921" end="00:46:22.121" style="s2">please.</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.521" end="00:46:24.721" style="s2">Sebastian,</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.121" end="00:46:24.721" style="s2">please.</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.221" end="00:46:35.121" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.921" end="00:46:37.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena,</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.121" end="00:46:39.521" style="s2">it&#39;s me,</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.321" end="00:46:41.467" style="s2">Sebastian Kingsley.</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.521" end="00:46:43.487" style="s2">You did this to her.</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.467" end="00:46:43.487" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.121" end="00:46:47.421" style="s2">I&#39;ve made up my mind.</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.021" end="00:46:49.921" style="s2">One day,</p>
<p begin="00:46:47.421" end="00:46:52.621" style="s2">I&#39;ll erase you from her life</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.921" end="00:46:52.621" style="s2">completely.</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.121" end="00:46:58.721" style="s2">It&#39;s It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.121" end="00:46:59.823" style="s2">You can cry.</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.721" end="00:47:01.422" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to hold it together in</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.823" end="00:47:02.922" style="s2">front of me.</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.422" end="00:47:04.223" style="s2">Let it all out.</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.922" end="00:47:07.667" style="s2">10 years of it.</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.223" end="00:47:08.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why? Why did he treat me like that?</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.667" end="00:47:09.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.223" end="00:47:11.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.323" end="00:47:12.252" style="s2">I&#39;ve got you. Just cry.</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.523" end="00:47:14.272" style="s2">I&#39;m right here.</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.252" end="00:47:14.272" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:47:16.182" end="00:47:18.202" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.557" end="00:47:36.122" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.422" end="00:47:37.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex?</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.122" end="00:47:39.422" style="s2">Were you here all night?</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.922" end="00:47:41.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were in bad shape last night. I</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.422" end="00:47:43.023" style="s2">wasn&#39;t going anywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:47:41.023" end="00:47:44.223" style="s2">You cried yourself out, fell asleep in</p>
<p begin="00:47:43.023" end="00:47:46.823" style="s2">my arms.</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.223" end="00:47:48.323" style="s2">I carried you up.</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.823" end="00:47:51.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.323" end="00:47:51.223" style="s2">I really lost it.</p>
<p begin="00:47:52.023" end="00:47:55.122" style="s2">Alex,</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.323" end="00:47:56.323" style="s2">there&#39;s a part of my past I can&#39;t talk</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.122" end="00:47:58.122" style="s2">about.</p>
<p begin="00:47:56.323" end="00:47:59.323" style="s2">Not even now. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:47:58.122" end="00:48:01.223" style="s2">humiliating.</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.323" end="00:48:02.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I get it. You don&#39;t owe anyone that, not</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.223" end="00:48:04.622" style="s2">even me. If you don&#39;t want to say it,</p>
<p begin="00:48:02.723" end="00:48:06.223" style="s2">then don&#39;t. Not now, not ever. I care</p>
<p begin="00:48:04.622" end="00:48:06.922" style="s2">about who you are now and who you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.223" end="00:48:08.223" style="s2">becoming.</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.922" end="00:48:09.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.223" end="00:48:11.122" style="s2">for staying.</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.823" end="00:48:13.023" style="s2">I thought</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.122" end="00:48:15.523" style="s2">maybe you just felt sorry for me.</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.023" end="00:48:18.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Not pity, never.</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.523" end="00:48:18.723" style="s2">Just love. That&#39;s it.</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.023" end="00:48:27.223" style="s2">The Sinclair name exists for one reason,</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.723" end="00:48:28.323" style="s2">to give you a place nothing can ever</p>
<p begin="00:48:27.223" end="00:48:30.523" style="s2">take from you.</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.323" end="00:48:33.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The sunlight feels warm.</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.523" end="00:48:34.922" style="s2">For the first time, it&#39;s quiet inside.</p>
<p begin="00:48:33.323" end="00:48:39.023" style="s2">All the nightmares that haunted me for</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.922" end="00:48:39.023" style="s2">10 years, finally gone.</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.723" end="00:48:46.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really think you&#39;ve won, Alexander?</p>
<p begin="00:48:44.622" end="00:48:48.422" style="s2">You&#39;re just a scavenger</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.422" end="00:48:50.622" style="s2">showing up when things fall apart.</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.422" end="00:48:52.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena and I had 10 years.</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.622" end="00:48:53.922" style="s2">10 years. You think your money erases</p>
<p begin="00:48:52.823" end="00:48:55.122" style="s2">that?</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.922" end="00:48:56.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10 years?</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.122" end="00:48:57.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:48:56.523" end="00:48:59.922" style="s2">10 years of history.</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.922" end="00:49:01.524" style="s2">10 years she relied on me. You&#39;re just</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.922" end="00:49:04.324" style="s2">picking up what I threw away. What&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.524" end="00:49:04.324" style="s2">there to be proud of?</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.024" end="00:49:11.524" style="s2">Since you&#39;re so obsessed with those 10</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.524" end="00:49:11.524" style="s2">years, let&#39;s settle it like men.</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.724" end="00:49:25.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That one&#39;s for 10 years of tearing her</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.224" end="00:49:27.224" style="s2">down.</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.924" end="00:49:29.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You spent 10 years teaching her to</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.224" end="00:49:31.924" style="s2">shrink, to doubt herself, to live in</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.224" end="00:49:31.924" style="s2">your shadow.</p>
<p begin="00:49:32.124" end="00:49:34.924" style="s2">I only needed 10 days to bring her back</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.724" end="00:49:36.624" style="s2">to life.</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.924" end="00:49:37.924" style="s2">Stay away from Elena.</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.624" end="00:49:39.624" style="s2">Show up again,</p>
<p begin="00:49:37.924" end="00:49:43.724" style="s2">next time you don&#39;t just lose your</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.624" end="00:49:43.724" style="s2">inheritance, you lose your life.</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.024" end="00:49:51.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You got into a fight. You run Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.224" end="00:49:52.924" style="s2">Capital. What if you got seriously hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.124" end="00:49:54.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just took out some trash, got a little</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.924" end="00:49:56.024" style="s2">workout in.</p>
<p begin="00:49:54.124" end="00:49:57.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t do that again. I mean it. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.024" end="00:49:58.424" style="s2">worry.</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.324" end="00:49:59.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dominic just checked in. We&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:49:58.424" end="00:50:02.224" style="s2">officially moved on the Kingsley South</p>
<p begin="00:49:59.924" end="00:50:03.624" style="s2">American Clemium project full takeover.</p>
<p begin="00:50:02.224" end="00:50:04.924" style="s2">By tomorrow night, Sebastian won&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.624" end="00:50:07.224" style="s2">be able to afford a cheap bottle of</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.924" end="00:50:07.224" style="s2">whiskey.</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.724" end="00:50:14.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You useless piece of trash. Look at what</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.224" end="00:50:17.424" style="s2">you&#39;ve done. He bought out the entire</p>
<p begin="00:50:14.624" end="00:50:18.524" style="s2">lithium project. EVERYTHING I BUILT GONE</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.424" end="00:50:20.824" style="s2">BECAUSE OF YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.524" end="00:50:22.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DAD, I just wanted what was mine. I</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.824" end="00:50:23.924" style="s2">didn&#39;t think he&#39;d go this far.</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.324" end="00:50:26.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yours?</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.924" end="00:50:28.524" style="s2">You don&#39;t have anything left</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.324" end="00:50:30.424" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.524" end="00:50:33.324" style="s2">You&#39;re not even worth a patch of grass</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.424" end="00:50:35.424" style="s2">at Sinclair Manor. Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.324" end="00:50:37.724" style="s2">Before this family goes bankrupt, I</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.424" end="00:50:41.024" style="s2">don&#39;t want to see your face again.</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.724" end="00:50:41.024" style="s2">Everyone&#39;s turned on me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.324" end="00:50:46.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian,</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.924" end="00:50:46.824" style="s2">I&#39;m pregnant. It&#39;s yours.</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.524" end="00:50:54.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pregnant? No. That&#39;s impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.624" end="00:50:56.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was blackout drunk that night. I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.724" end="00:50:57.924" style="s2">remember a thing.</p>
<p begin="00:50:56.724" end="00:50:59.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So tell me,</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.924" end="00:51:00.524" style="s2">whose kid is it?</p>
<p begin="00:50:59.324" end="00:51:02.125" style="s2">You really think you can trap me with a</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.524" end="00:51:04.725" style="s2">lie like this?</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.125" end="00:51:06.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re [snorts] insane. It is yours. If</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.725" end="00:51:10.425" style="s2">you don&#39;t believe me, we&#39;ll go to the</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.125" end="00:51:10.425" style="s2">hospital right now and do a DNA test.</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.295" end="00:51:15.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing and music]</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.825" end="00:51:18.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want the title? Fine. Then we all GO</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.825" end="00:51:20.025" style="s2">DOWN TOGETHER, YOU AND THAT BASTARD.</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.025" end="00:51:21.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STOP THE CAR.</p>
<p begin="00:51:20.025" end="00:51:24.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LET&#39;S SEE IF GOD FORGIVES LIARS LIKE</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.925" end="00:51:24.325" style="s2">YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.725" end="00:51:38.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU PIECE OF TRASH. YOU TRIED TO KILL MY</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.625" end="00:51:40.425" style="s2">daughter and grandchild.</p>
<p begin="00:51:38.625" end="00:51:42.725" style="s2">If anything happens to Isabella, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:51:40.425" end="00:51:43.425" style="s2">bury the entire Kingsley family WITH</p>
<p begin="00:51:42.725" end="00:51:46.025" style="s2">YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.425" end="00:51:48.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU MURDERER. YOU COULDN&#39;T have Elena,</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.025" end="00:51:50.625" style="s2">SO YOU DECIDED TO DESTROY MY DAUGHTER?</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.625" end="00:51:52.625" style="s2">WHEN YOU DROVE INTO THAT GUARD RAIL, DID</p>
<p begin="00:51:50.625" end="00:51:53.625" style="s2">YOU EVEN THINK ABOUT THE TWO LIVES IN</p>
<p begin="00:51:52.625" end="00:51:55.215" style="s2">THAT CAR?</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.625" end="00:51:56.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IT was an accident.</p>
<p begin="00:51:55.215" end="00:51:58.490" style="s2">[laughter] Accident.</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.725" end="00:52:00.125" style="s2">I was just trying to scare her.</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.490" end="00:52:02.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts and clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.125" end="00:52:04.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Kingsley, calm down. The victim is</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.325" end="00:52:05.525" style="s2">awake. She has a statement to give.</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.425" end="00:52:06.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.525" end="00:52:08.625" style="s2">When he found out I was pregnant, he</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.725" end="00:52:10.125" style="s2">lost it.</p>
<p begin="00:52:08.625" end="00:52:11.225" style="s2">In the car, he said he&#39;d take me to hell</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.125" end="00:52:12.825" style="s2">with him.</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.225" end="00:52:14.125" style="s2">Then he sped up and drove straight into</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.825" end="00:52:15.325" style="s2">the guard rail.</p>
<p begin="00:52:14.125" end="00:52:18.125" style="s2">That wasn&#39;t an accident. That was</p>
<p begin="00:52:15.325" end="00:52:20.625" style="s2">attempted murder. Breaking news. An</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.125" end="00:52:23.225" style="s2">attempted murder scandal rocks Onyx</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.625" end="00:52:25.125" style="s2">Harbor&#39;s elite. Kingsley heir allegedly</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.225" end="00:52:27.525" style="s2">to drive his pregnant partner off a</p>
<p begin="00:52:25.125" end="00:52:29.525" style="s2">cliff. Police are now investigating.</p>
<p begin="00:52:27.525" end="00:52:33.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going to turn the name Kingsley into</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.525" end="00:52:33.325" style="s2">a permanent stain on this city.</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.025" end="00:52:39.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Name your price. What will it take for</p>
<p begin="00:52:37.925" end="00:52:42.225" style="s2">Isabella to drop the charges?</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.825" end="00:52:43.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First, Sebastian marries Isabella.</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.225" end="00:52:46.025" style="s2">Immediately, my daughter and my</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.525" end="00:52:48.725" style="s2">grandchild get a name. Second, you have</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.025" end="00:52:51.225" style="s2">that estate, Emerald Manor, worth 50</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.725" end="00:52:52.825" style="s2">million. Transfer it to Isabella now.</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.225" end="00:52:54.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THAT&#39;S INSANE.</p>
<p begin="00:52:52.825" end="00:52:57.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SHUT UP.</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.725" end="00:53:01.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IF YOU DON&#39;T SIGN, WE&#39;LL be negotiating</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.625" end="00:53:05.727" style="s2">bankruptcy from A PRISON CELL TOMORROW.</p>
<p begin="00:53:01.525" end="00:53:05.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t a wedding. It&#39;s my funeral.</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.527" end="00:53:11.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Kingsley, this black handmade suit</p>
<p begin="00:53:09.827" end="00:53:13.827" style="s2">just came in.</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.127" end="00:53:13.827" style="s2">Would you like to try it on?</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.627" end="00:53:16.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:53:17.927" end="00:53:20.727" style="s2">The wedding&#39;s next week. If the fit&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:53:20.227" end="00:53:22.727" style="s2">off</p>
<p begin="00:53:20.727" end="00:53:25.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then fix it.</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.727" end="00:53:25.227" style="s2">Doesn&#39;t matter.</p>
<p begin="00:53:26.327" end="00:53:30.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Higher angle and get my waist no,</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.327" end="00:53:33.427" style="s2">tighter. I want everyone in Onyx port to</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.327" end="00:53:33.427" style="s2">see who actually won.</p>
<p begin="00:53:35.827" end="00:53:38.627" style="s2">Elena</p>
<p begin="00:53:37.327" end="00:53:40.527" style="s2">See it.</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.627" end="00:53:42.727" style="s2">Your man.</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.527" end="00:53:45.427" style="s2">Your place.</p>
<p begin="00:53:42.727" end="00:53:47.627" style="s2">It&#39;s all mine now.</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.427" end="00:53:50.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough, Sebastian. The wedding&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.627" end="00:53:51.827" style="s2">set. Get it together.</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.127" end="00:53:53.327" style="s2">This family can&#39;t take another hit.</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.827" end="00:53:55.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, this was sent from Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.327" end="00:53:56.127" style="s2">Manor. A wedding gift for the young</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.227" end="00:53:57.727" style="s2">master.</p>
<p begin="00:53:56.127" end="00:54:02.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander?</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.727" end="00:54:02.127" style="s2">Since when does he send gifts? Open it.</p>
<p begin="00:54:13.027" end="00:54:17.727" style="s2">Congratulations, my dear nephew.</p>
<p begin="00:54:15.627" end="00:54:21.227" style="s2">May you find peace</p>
<p begin="00:54:17.727" end="00:54:23.027" style="s2">in your golden cage, Alexander Sinclair.</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.227" end="00:54:26.027" style="s2">He&#39;s not congratulating us. He&#39;s warning</p>
<p begin="00:54:23.027" end="00:54:29.127" style="s2">us. We&#39;re trapped for life by that woman</p>
<p begin="00:54:26.027" end="00:54:33.127" style="s2">and that child. Get it out now. I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:54:29.127" end="00:54:33.127" style="s2">want that cursed thing in this house.</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.382" end="00:54:36.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.827" end="00:54:44.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow, the real bride&#39;s gone and the</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.127" end="00:54:46.127" style="s2">replacement wasted no time. Heard she</p>
<p begin="00:54:44.427" end="00:54:47.627" style="s2">locked him down with a pregnancy.</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.127" end="00:54:49.527" style="s2">Otherwise, no way the Kingstons would</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.627" end="00:54:51.227" style="s2">let her in.</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.527" end="00:54:54.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at Sebastian. He looks like he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:54:51.227" end="00:54:54.427" style="s2">about to be executed.</p>
<p begin="00:54:57.127" end="00:55:01.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian Kingsley, do you take Isabella</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.327" end="00:55:03.627" style="s2">Blackburn to be your lawfully wedded</p>
<p begin="00:55:01.227" end="00:55:03.627" style="s2">wife?</p>
<p begin="00:55:12.728" end="00:55:17.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll give you the name, the title, all</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.328" end="00:55:21.028" style="s2">the status you wanted.</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.228" end="00:55:22.328" style="s2">But my heart, you already killed it.</p>
<p begin="00:55:21.028" end="00:55:24.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.328" end="00:55:24.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="00:55:34.643" end="00:55:36.663" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:55:38.028" end="00:55:40.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian, you&#39;ve had too much. Let me</p>
<p begin="00:55:39.928" end="00:55:42.228" style="s2">help you.</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.228" end="00:55:45.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch me.</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.228" end="00:55:48.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won. I&#39;m Mrs. Kingsley now.</p>
<p begin="00:55:45.328" end="00:55:48.828" style="s2">I took everything from her.</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.328" end="00:55:56.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pierre, I want to redo the base here.</p>
<p begin="00:55:54.328" end="00:55:58.128" style="s2">Scrap the heavy bezel setting. Switch it</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.328" end="00:56:00.328" style="s2">to a minimal prong setting.</p>
<p begin="00:55:58.128" end="00:56:02.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The center stone&#39;s pretty large. Prong</p>
<p begin="00:56:00.328" end="00:56:02.828" style="s2">setting looks great, but it might not be</p>
<p begin="00:56:02.028" end="00:56:05.728" style="s2">stable enough.</p>
<p begin="00:56:02.828" end="00:56:07.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Less restriction, more brilliance.</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.728" end="00:56:09.528" style="s2">I want it to feel like it&#39;s breaking</p>
<p begin="00:56:07.028" end="00:56:09.528" style="s2">free.</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.928" end="00:56:16.328" style="s2">Elena,</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.428" end="00:56:16.328" style="s2">it&#39;s a dress to you.</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.328" end="00:56:25.928" style="s2">Elena, did you see this? Those two</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.728" end="00:56:29.228" style="s2">actually got married. The whole city&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.928" end="00:56:31.228" style="s2">laughing. This is beyond shameless.</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.228" end="00:56:32.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, back to it. For the tassel</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.228" end="00:56:35.128" style="s2">section, I think we can shave another</p>
<p begin="00:56:32.928" end="00:56:36.528" style="s2">half millimeter off the platinum ratio.</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.128" end="00:56:39.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The woman who used to bend over</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.528" end="00:56:41.228" style="s2">backwards for love, she&#39;s gone.</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.228" end="00:56:45.728" style="s2">What&#39;s left is a designer,</p>
<p begin="00:56:41.228" end="00:56:45.728" style="s2">focused, sharp, untouchable.</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.528" end="00:56:54.828" style="s2">Sending this</p>
<p begin="00:56:53.828" end="00:56:55.828" style="s2">what?</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.828" end="00:56:57.828" style="s2">A warning?</p>
<p begin="00:56:55.828" end="00:56:59.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect timing. Come take a look at</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.828" end="00:57:01.728" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.428" end="00:57:03.628" style="s2">The jewelry she picked, completely wrong</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.728" end="00:57:04.928" style="s2">for that dress. That heavy Kingsley</p>
<p begin="00:57:03.628" end="00:57:06.528" style="s2">aramode necklace kills the whole</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.928" end="00:57:08.228" style="s2">silhouette. It&#39;s a mess.</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.528" end="00:57:08.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve been staring at this</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.228" end="00:57:11.129" style="s2">for that?</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.828" end="00:57:13.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. As a designer, bad</p>
<p begin="00:57:11.129" end="00:57:15.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; taste is the one thing I don&#39;t forgive.</p>
<p begin="00:57:13.829" end="00:57:17.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guess the title Mrs. Kingsley didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:57:15.529" end="00:57:18.529" style="s2">upgrade her taste.</p>
<p begin="00:57:17.129" end="00:57:20.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Real elegance doesn&#39;t come stolen</p>
<p begin="00:57:18.529" end="00:57:21.529" style="s2">jewelry.</p>
<p begin="00:57:20.329" end="00:57:25.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right now,</p>
<p begin="00:57:21.529" end="00:57:25.329" style="s2">she outshines every gem in this room.</p>
<p begin="00:57:33.029" end="00:57:37.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These tulips, they&#39;re beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.529" end="00:57:38.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They were my mother&#39;s favorite. She used</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.029" end="00:57:39.929" style="s2">to say white tulips meant purity</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.729" end="00:57:41.029" style="s2">regained.</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.929" end="00:57:42.429" style="s2">But to me,</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.029" end="00:57:45.729" style="s2">they&#39;re more like her.</p>
<p begin="00:57:42.429" end="00:57:47.729" style="s2">Gentle but unbreakable. I was 18.</p>
<p begin="00:57:45.729" end="00:57:50.029" style="s2">At a Kingsley charity gala, Victor</p>
<p begin="00:57:47.729" end="00:57:52.429" style="s2">pointed at me in front of everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:57:50.029" end="00:57:54.529" style="s2">Called me a bloodless parasite.</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.429" end="00:57:56.729" style="s2">That night, they cut me off. Every trust</p>
<p begin="00:57:54.529" end="00:57:59.229" style="s2">fund threw me out like I was nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:57:56.729" end="00:58:00.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex.</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.229" end="00:58:02.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was a blizzard in London.</p>
<p begin="00:58:00.829" end="00:58:04.929" style="s2">I had nothing except a diamond ring my</p>
<p begin="00:58:02.629" end="00:58:06.629" style="s2">mother left me. I pawned it. That became</p>
<p begin="00:58:04.929" end="00:58:08.129" style="s2">my first stake in a hedge fund. Every</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.629" end="00:58:11.329" style="s2">night in London,</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.129" end="00:58:11.329" style="s2">I was planning how to come back.</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.529" end="00:58:16.729" style="s2">From now on, the St. Clair name is your</p>
<p begin="00:58:15.329" end="00:58:18.629" style="s2">shield.</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.729" end="00:58:22.529" style="s2">As long as I&#39;m here,</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.629" end="00:58:22.529" style="s2">no one on this island touches you again.</p>
<p begin="00:58:25.929" end="00:58:28.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex.</p>
<p begin="00:58:31.929" end="00:58:35.629" style="s2">Stay</p>
<p begin="00:58:33.029" end="00:58:35.629" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:58:46.929" end="00:58:52.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sleep well, Mrs. St. Clair.</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.029" end="00:58:54.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:58:52.729" end="00:58:56.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, invitation from the Kingsley</p>
<p begin="00:58:54.429" end="00:58:58.329" style="s2">Foundation gala. The patriarch</p>
<p begin="00:58:56.129" end="00:59:00.529" style="s2">specifically requested your presence.</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.329" end="00:59:02.129" style="s2">A power handover ceremony?</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.529" end="00:59:03.829" style="s2">Guess the old man wants one last look at</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.129" end="00:59:05.029" style="s2">where I draw the line. If you don&#39;t want</p>
<p begin="00:59:03.829" end="00:59:06.029" style="s2">to go,</p>
<p begin="00:59:05.029" end="00:59:06.829" style="s2">we can tear it up right now.</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.029" end="00:59:08.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.829" end="00:59:10.729" style="s2">I&#39;m going. I want everyone on Obsidian</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.729" end="00:59:12.231" style="s2">Island to see it. Walking away from that</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.729" end="00:59:13.331" style="s2">rotten fake engagement was the best</p>
<p begin="00:59:12.231" end="00:59:15.531" style="s2">decision I&#39;ve ever made.</p>
<p begin="00:59:13.331" end="00:59:18.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. But before that,</p>
<p begin="00:59:15.531" end="00:59:18.231" style="s2">I want to meet your family.</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.531" end="00:59:37.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle Robert, Chloe, this is my husband</p>
<p begin="00:59:36.131" end="00:59:39.131" style="s2">Alexander Sinclair.</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.431" end="00:59:40.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Husband?</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.131" end="00:59:42.431" style="s2">You mean</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.531" end="00:59:44.331" style="s2">the Alexander Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:59:42.431" end="00:59:46.831" style="s2">from Sinclair Capital?</p>
<p begin="00:59:44.331" end="00:59:48.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god. My cousin married that guy?</p>
<p begin="00:59:46.831" end="00:59:49.431" style="s2">The predator?</p>
<p begin="00:59:48.131" end="00:59:51.931" style="s2">This is insane. This is better than a</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.431" end="00:59:51.931" style="s2">movie.</p>
<p begin="00:59:57.956" end="01:00:00.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:59:58.731" end="01:00:02.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle Robert, Elena told me about your</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.531" end="01:00:04.331" style="s2">workshop. You still use traditional</p>
<p begin="01:00:02.531" end="01:00:06.131" style="s2">techniques. That kind of craftsmanship</p>
<p begin="01:00:04.331" end="01:00:08.631" style="s2">is rare these days.</p>
<p begin="01:00:06.131" end="01:00:10.531" style="s2">I respect that.</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.631" end="01:00:12.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena&#39;s had it rough, especially with</p>
<p begin="01:00:10.531" end="01:00:13.331" style="s2">the Black houses. Seeing how you treat</p>
<p begin="01:00:12.531" end="01:00:15.831" style="s2">her,</p>
<p begin="01:00:13.331" end="01:00:16.831" style="s2">I can finally let go. Alexander, please</p>
<p begin="01:00:15.831" end="01:00:18.531" style="s2">take care of her.</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.831" end="01:00:20.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have my word. Protecting her, that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.531" end="01:00:21.831" style="s2">the most important thing in my life.</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.131" end="01:00:23.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At [music] last, I have someone in this</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.831" end="01:00:25.531" style="s2">world to lean on. Alex, where are you</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.531" end="01:00:27.031" style="s2">taking me?</p>
<p begin="01:00:25.531" end="01:00:30.431" style="s2">What&#39;s with all the mystery?</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.031" end="01:00:33.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax. Count with me. Three, two,</p>
<p begin="01:00:30.431" end="01:00:33.631" style="s2">one. Look.</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.631" end="01:00:36.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This</p>
<p begin="01:00:35.431" end="01:00:38.631" style="s2">What is this?</p>
<p begin="01:00:36.231" end="01:00:40.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s 2 km from your uncle&#39;s place.</p>
<p begin="01:00:38.631" end="01:00:42.031" style="s2">I wanted you close to family, but with a</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.531" end="01:00:44.031" style="s2">home that&#39;s truly yours.</p>
<p begin="01:00:42.031" end="01:00:44.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex, you always know exactly where my</p>
<p begin="01:00:44.031" end="01:00:46.731" style="s2">heart is.</p>
<p begin="01:00:44.731" end="01:00:48.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From now on, this is your safe harbor in</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.731" end="01:00:51.531" style="s2">Anic Port.</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.231" end="01:00:51.531" style="s2">Go on. There&#39;s more inside.</p>
<p begin="01:00:54.831" end="01:00:57.731" style="s2">All picked for you.</p>
<p begin="01:00:58.531" end="01:01:01.231" style="s2">Go on.</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.931" end="01:01:03.631" style="s2">Try one.</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.231" end="01:01:03.631" style="s2">Your favorite.</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.131" end="01:01:08.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you think?</p>
<p begin="01:01:06.531" end="01:01:12.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too much. I don&#39;t want every man in that</p>
<p begin="01:01:08.531" end="01:01:12.831" style="s2">room staring at your back. Try this one.</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.332" end="01:01:21.532" style="s2">Perfect.</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.832" end="01:01:23.932" style="s2">Tonight, you just shine. I&#39;ll handle the</p>
<p begin="01:01:21.532" end="01:01:23.932" style="s2">rest.</p>
<p begin="01:01:35.432" end="01:01:39.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god. Is that Elena? How is she</p>
<p begin="01:01:37.732" end="01:01:40.032" style="s2">with Alexander Sinclair?</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.132" end="01:01:43.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well,</p>
<p begin="01:01:40.032" end="01:01:43.332" style="s2">this just got interesting.</p>
<p begin="01:01:46.132" end="01:01:51.532" style="s2">Everyone,</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.332" end="01:01:51.532" style="s2">this is my wife, Elena Sinclair.</p>
<p begin="01:01:59.032" end="01:02:02.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know she&#39;s with my uncle, but what</p>
<p begin="01:02:00.532" end="01:02:05.032" style="s2">gives her the nerve to show up here?</p>
<p begin="01:02:02.732" end="01:02:06.932" style="s2">What, she came to watch me fall apart?</p>
<p begin="01:02:05.032" end="01:02:08.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop looking. I&#39;m the center of</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.932" end="01:02:11.932" style="s2">attention tonight. Every woman in this</p>
<p begin="01:02:08.832" end="01:02:11.932" style="s2">city wishes they were me.</p>
<p begin="01:02:26.432" end="01:02:29.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god.</p>
<p begin="01:02:28.232" end="01:02:30.932" style="s2">It&#39;s Elena?</p>
<p begin="01:02:29.632" end="01:02:33.332" style="s2">Since when did she look like that?</p>
<p begin="01:02:30.932" end="01:02:36.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put her next to Isabella. Isabella looks</p>
<p begin="01:02:33.332" end="01:02:36.732" style="s2">like a discount extra.</p>
<p begin="01:02:45.332" end="01:02:49.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ELENA, WHAT ARE you playing at? You know</p>
<p begin="01:02:47.832" end="01:02:49.932" style="s2">exactly what tonight is. How dare you</p>
<p begin="01:02:49.532" end="01:02:51.532" style="s2">show up?</p>
<p begin="01:02:49.932" end="01:02:55.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch your mouth, Sebastian. In public,</p>
<p begin="01:02:51.532" end="01:02:55.132" style="s2">you show basic respect to your elders.</p>
<p begin="01:02:56.732" end="01:03:00.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nice to see you, nephew.</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.732" end="01:03:06.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In grace and presence,</p>
<p begin="01:03:04.632" end="01:03:09.732" style="s2">Elena was always the better match, not</p>
<p begin="01:03:06.732" end="01:03:11.532" style="s2">that crying, useless girl. Too late now.</p>
<p begin="01:03:09.732" end="01:03:12.532" style="s2">What a rare sight. What should I call</p>
<p begin="01:03:11.532" end="01:03:14.832" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="01:03:12.532" end="01:03:15.932" style="s2">The almost daughter-in-law or my current</p>
<p begin="01:03:14.832" end="01:03:17.532" style="s2">sister-in-law?</p>
<p begin="01:03:15.932" end="01:03:19.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Titles don&#39;t matter, sister-in-law, but</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.532" end="01:03:22.133" style="s2">do pass along my regards to Victor.</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.533" end="01:03:24.333" style="s2">That South African lithium project,</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.133" end="01:03:27.533" style="s2">I bought it.</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.333" end="01:03:29.133" style="s2">Guess he&#39;s scrambling for diamonds now.</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.533" end="01:03:31.133" style="s2">Funny, I&#39;ve got my eye on that diamond</p>
<p begin="01:03:29.133" end="01:03:33.933" style="s2">mine, too. Seems the Kingsley bloodline</p>
<p begin="01:03:31.133" end="01:03:35.333" style="s2">has very consistent taste in business</p>
<p begin="01:03:33.933" end="01:03:36.633" style="s2">and in women.</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.333" end="01:03:39.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forget it. I should go go check on</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.633" end="01:03:39.533" style="s2">Victor. Excuse me.</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.733" end="01:03:51.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To you,</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.333" end="01:03:51.033" style="s2">Mr. Sinclair.</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.133" end="01:04:06.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10 years,</p>
<p begin="01:04:04.533" end="01:04:06.833" style="s2">right?</p>
<p begin="01:04:08.133" end="01:04:12.133" style="s2">Just</p>
<p begin="01:04:09.033" end="01:04:12.133" style="s2">makes my skin crawl.</p>
<p begin="01:04:12.733" end="01:04:19.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll handle it. He&#39;s done bothering you.</p>
<p begin="01:04:16.633" end="01:04:21.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, come out. I KNOW YOU&#39;RE IN THERE.</p>
<p begin="01:04:19.733" end="01:04:24.133" style="s2">OPEN THE DOOR.</p>
<p begin="01:04:21.733" end="01:04:25.733" style="s2">ELENA, CALLING ME YOUR NEPHEW. Who do</p>
<p begin="01:04:24.133" end="01:04:28.333" style="s2">you think you are?</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.733" end="01:04:30.933" style="s2">Gold Dieter, you really think Alexander</p>
<p begin="01:04:28.333" end="01:04:30.933" style="s2">loves you?</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.633" end="01:04:35.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, Sebastian&#39;s back. He&#39;s drunk. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.733" end="01:04:37.233" style="s2">worried he might do something stupid.</p>
<p begin="01:04:35.433" end="01:04:39.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle, it&#39;s Alexander. Don&#39;t open the</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.233" end="01:04:41.433" style="s2">door. Don&#39;t engage. I&#39;ll take care of</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.333" end="01:04:41.433" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.233" end="01:04:52.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You, Sinclair bastard, you think you can</p>
<p begin="01:04:51.633" end="01:04:55.033" style="s2">touch me?</p>
<p begin="01:04:52.433" end="01:04:57.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen carefully. What you call love,</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.033" end="01:04:59.033" style="s2">it&#39;s pathetic, cheap, just control.</p>
<p begin="01:04:57.933" end="01:05:00.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you?</p>
<p begin="01:04:59.033" end="01:05:02.233" style="s2">You really love her? You&#39;re just using</p>
<p begin="01:05:00.833" end="01:05:04.033" style="s2">her to get back at us.</p>
<p begin="01:05:02.233" end="01:05:07.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t compare us.</p>
<p begin="01:05:04.033" end="01:05:07.333" style="s2">Elena is my line.</p>
<p begin="01:05:08.133" end="01:05:11.133" style="s2">The only one.</p>
<p begin="01:05:09.633" end="01:05:12.833" style="s2">Stay away from her.</p>
<p begin="01:05:11.133" end="01:05:14.033" style="s2">Don&#39;t even look at her, or I&#39;ll make</p>
<p begin="01:05:12.833" end="01:05:16.533" style="s2">sure you don&#39;t live long enough to</p>
<p begin="01:05:14.033" end="01:05:16.533" style="s2">regret it.</p>
<p begin="01:05:24.735" end="01:05:29.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isabella, the nursery has to have</p>
<p begin="01:05:26.635" end="01:05:31.135" style="s2">Italian silk wall panels. Soft tones</p>
<p begin="01:05:29.235" end="01:05:33.435" style="s2">only. We can&#39;t have anything upsetting</p>
<p begin="01:05:31.135" end="01:05:35.535" style="s2">the Kingsley family&#39;s first grandson.</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.435" end="01:05:37.735" style="s2">This kind of cold shoulder, it&#39;s cheaper</p>
<p begin="01:05:35.535" end="01:05:41.135" style="s2">than an insult. Do they really think I</p>
<p begin="01:05:37.735" end="01:05:41.135" style="s2">still care about their approval?</p>
<p begin="01:05:42.735" end="01:05:45.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We shouldn&#39;t have come. I wouldn&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="01:05:43.735" end="01:05:47.335" style="s2">put you through this.</p>
<p begin="01:05:45.435" end="01:05:48.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine, Alex.</p>
<p begin="01:05:47.335" end="01:05:50.335" style="s2">Doesn&#39;t bother me.</p>
<p begin="01:05:48.235" end="01:05:53.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander, the South African diamond</p>
<p begin="01:05:50.335" end="01:05:54.735" style="s2">mine, fully under our control now. Real</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.035" end="01:05:56.635" style="s2">assets like that,</p>
<p begin="01:05:54.735" end="01:05:59.520" style="s2">not something a numbers guy like you</p>
<p begin="01:05:56.635" end="01:06:00.235" style="s2">gets to play with.</p>
<p begin="01:05:59.520" end="01:06:02.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:06:00.235" end="01:06:02.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that right?</p>
<p begin="01:06:05.135" end="01:06:09.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ladies and gentlemen, though Mr. David</p>
<p begin="01:06:07.235" end="01:06:11.435" style="s2">is unwell, he&#39;s asked that an important</p>
<p begin="01:06:09.335" end="01:06:13.335" style="s2">decision be announced tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:06:11.435" end="01:06:16.035" style="s2">Mr. David has decided to gift the</p>
<p begin="01:06:13.335" end="01:06:18.435" style="s2">Montauk Seaside Estate to Mr. Sebastian</p>
<p begin="01:06:16.035" end="01:06:20.935" style="s2">as a wedding present. In addition, as</p>
<p begin="01:06:18.435" end="01:06:23.035" style="s2">Mr. Alexander is now married, Mr. David</p>
<p begin="01:06:20.935" end="01:06:24.935" style="s2">has allocated 30% of the core shares in</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.035" end="01:06:26.135" style="s2">the South African diamond project along</p>
<p begin="01:06:24.935" end="01:06:28.435" style="s2">with permanent development rights to</p>
<p begin="01:06:26.135" end="01:06:31.235" style="s2">Montauk Real Estate to Mr. Alexander and</p>
<p begin="01:06:28.435" end="01:06:33.735" style="s2">his wife, Elena.</p>
<p begin="01:06:31.235" end="01:06:36.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is insane. He&#39;s lost his mind.</p>
<p begin="01:06:33.735" end="01:06:37.735" style="s2">GIVING CORE SHARES TO A BASTARD AND HER</p>
<p begin="01:06:36.135" end="01:06:38.135" style="s2">WHAT RIGHT DOES SHE HAVE TO KINGSLEY</p>
<p begin="01:06:37.735" end="01:06:40.035" style="s2">ASSETS?</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.135" end="01:06:41.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ELENA, WHAT DID YOU DO? What kind of</p>
<p begin="01:06:40.035" end="01:06:43.735" style="s2">tricks did you pull, you</p>
<p begin="01:06:41.735" end="01:06:46.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before you worry about shares, Victor,</p>
<p begin="01:06:43.735" end="01:06:48.235" style="s2">you might want to worry about yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:06:46.135" end="01:06:50.635" style="s2">Full paper trail, fraud, shell</p>
<p begin="01:06:48.235" end="01:06:52.835" style="s2">companies, money laundering, all tied to</p>
<p begin="01:06:50.635" end="01:06:55.235" style="s2">your South African operation, enough to</p>
<p begin="01:06:52.835" end="01:06:56.635" style="s2">prove you&#39;re unfit to run anything.</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.235" end="01:06:57.835" style="s2">How many years do you think that buys</p>
<p begin="01:06:56.635" end="01:07:00.135" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="01:06:57.835" end="01:07:02.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You You went after me?</p>
<p begin="01:07:00.135" end="01:07:06.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t go after you.</p>
<p begin="01:07:02.835" end="01:07:06.435" style="s2">I was asked to take out the trash.</p>
<p begin="01:07:08.935" end="01:07:13.035" style="s2">Listen carefully. Elena is the lady of</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.935" end="01:07:14.835" style="s2">the Sinclair family, and she is now part</p>
<p begin="01:07:13.035" end="01:07:16.835" style="s2">of the Kingsley family, whether you like</p>
<p begin="01:07:14.835" end="01:07:20.535" style="s2">it or not. So everyone at this table</p>
<p begin="01:07:16.835" end="01:07:20.535" style="s2">show her the respect she deserves.</p>
<p begin="01:07:28.336" end="01:07:32.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pathetic. Tactics like this.</p>
<p begin="01:07:31.136" end="01:07:35.336" style="s2">It&#39;s got Eleanor and Isabella written</p>
<p begin="01:07:32.736" end="01:07:35.336" style="s2">all over it.</p>
<p begin="01:07:35.536" end="01:07:38.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get some sleep. By tomorrow morning this</p>
<p begin="01:07:37.636" end="01:07:41.036" style="s2">noise disappears.</p>
<p begin="01:07:38.636" end="01:07:42.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Alex. That&#39;s too easy on them.</p>
<p begin="01:07:41.036" end="01:07:46.136" style="s2">Sebastian used amnesia to dodge</p>
<p begin="01:07:42.736" end="01:07:49.636" style="s2">everything before. This time</p>
<p begin="01:07:46.136" end="01:07:49.636" style="s2">I&#39;m giving them something bigger.</p>
<p begin="01:07:52.836" end="01:07:56.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like someone&#39;s volunteering.</p>
<p begin="01:07:55.436" end="01:07:59.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s see what kind of show they&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.736" end="01:07:59.436" style="s2">planned for me.</p>
<p begin="01:08:03.136" end="01:08:06.536" style="s2">Elena</p>
<p begin="01:08:04.436" end="01:08:08.036" style="s2">about the past. I hope you&#39;re not</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.536" end="01:08:10.536" style="s2">holding it against me.</p>
<p begin="01:08:08.036" end="01:08:12.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m carrying the Kingsley heir now. Some</p>
<p begin="01:08:10.536" end="01:08:15.536" style="s2">things weren&#39;t really up to me.</p>
<p begin="01:08:12.536" end="01:08:17.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Holding it against you? Not at all.</p>
<p begin="01:08:15.536" end="01:08:21.336" style="s2">I&#39;m technically your elder now. Looking</p>
<p begin="01:08:17.836" end="01:08:21.336" style="s2">out for you comes with the role.</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.136" end="01:08:26.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m glad you feel that way.</p>
<p begin="01:08:24.036" end="01:08:27.936" style="s2">Sebastian&#39;s had a bit too much to drink.</p>
<p begin="01:08:26.036" end="01:08:30.836" style="s2">Could you take me home? Maybe we can</p>
<p begin="01:08:27.936" end="01:08:32.436" style="s2">talk later, just the two of us?</p>
<p begin="01:08:30.836" end="01:08:36.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead.</p>
<p begin="01:08:32.436" end="01:08:36.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And we&#39;re hooked.</p>
<p begin="01:08:40.536" end="01:08:44.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, I&#39;ve actually been worried about</p>
<p begin="01:08:42.836" end="01:08:46.436" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:44.036" end="01:08:48.436" style="s2">A man like Alexander</p>
<p begin="01:08:46.436" end="01:08:50.136" style="s2">can he really make you feel safe?</p>
<p begin="01:08:48.436" end="01:08:53.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough, Isabella. No one else is</p>
<p begin="01:08:50.136" end="01:08:53.336" style="s2">here. Drop the act.</p>
<p begin="01:08:54.736" end="01:08:57.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re already Mrs. Sinclair. Why come</p>
<p begin="01:08:56.436" end="01:08:59.136" style="s2">back to the Kingsleys? Why stir</p>
<p begin="01:08:57.936" end="01:09:01.236" style="s2">everything up again?</p>
<p begin="01:08:59.136" end="01:09:02.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because what you own me you haven&#39;t paid</p>
<p begin="01:09:01.236" end="01:09:03.136" style="s2">back yet.</p>
<p begin="01:09:02.136" end="01:09:05.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really think getting into</p>
<p begin="01:09:03.136" end="01:09:07.036" style="s2">Alexander&#39;s bed changed anything? You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:09:05.136" end="01:09:09.136" style="s2">just a tool, his way of getting back at</p>
<p begin="01:09:07.036" end="01:09:11.536" style="s2">the Kingsleys. Once he&#39;s bored of you</p>
<p begin="01:09:09.136" end="01:09:13.236" style="s2">you&#39;ll end up worse than 10 years ago.</p>
<p begin="01:09:11.536" end="01:09:15.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One intersection.</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.236" end="01:09:15.536" style="s2">Two.</p>
<p begin="01:09:20.436" end="01:09:23.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.636" end="01:09:27.137" style="s2">you&#39;re awake. Thank God. Do you have any</p>
<p begin="01:09:23.936" end="01:09:27.137" style="s2">idea scared I was?</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.438" end="01:09:31.237" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir,</p>
<p begin="01:09:28.737" end="01:09:33.838" style="s2">who are you? Do we know each other?</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.237" end="01:09:36.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, what are you saying? It&#39;s me,</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.838" end="01:09:36.737" style="s2">Sebastian. We were together for 10</p>
<p begin="01:09:36.038" end="01:09:38.237" style="s2">years.</p>
<p begin="01:09:36.737" end="01:09:39.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:09:38.237" end="01:09:42.038" style="s2">I don&#39;t know any Sebastian. Stay away</p>
<p begin="01:09:39.838" end="01:09:45.498" style="s2">from me. Don&#39;t touch me. Alexander,</p>
<p begin="01:09:42.038" end="01:09:47.137" style="s2">where&#39;s my husband? I want Alexander.</p>
<p begin="01:09:45.498" end="01:09:49.637" style="s2">[gasps] Alexander,</p>
<p begin="01:09:47.137" end="01:09:51.737" style="s2">you&#39;re here. I was so scared. That man</p>
<p begin="01:09:49.637" end="01:09:53.137" style="s2">kept saying crazy things.</p>
<p begin="01:09:51.737" end="01:09:56.238" style="s2">My head hurts.</p>
<p begin="01:09:53.137" end="01:09:57.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian, my wife needs rest. Get out</p>
<p begin="01:09:56.238" end="01:09:59.038" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="01:09:57.137" end="01:10:00.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The impact caused a minor clot in Mrs.</p>
<p begin="01:09:59.038" end="01:10:02.438" style="s2">Sinclair&#39;s brain. It&#39;s pressing on the</p>
<p begin="01:10:00.838" end="01:10:04.137" style="s2">area responsible for memory.</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.438" end="01:10:05.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But not me. Then why does she remember</p>
<p begin="01:10:04.137" end="01:10:06.637" style="s2">Alexander?</p>
<p begin="01:10:05.137" end="01:10:08.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of selective amnesia.</p>
<p begin="01:10:06.637" end="01:10:10.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a brain protect self by blocking</p>
<p begin="01:10:08.137" end="01:10:11.338" style="s2">out memories tied to extreme pain or</p>
<p begin="01:10:10.038" end="01:10:12.938" style="s2">emotional distress.</p>
<p begin="01:10:11.338" end="01:10:15.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So</p>
<p begin="01:10:12.938" end="01:10:18.038" style="s2">those 10 years with me</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.137" end="01:10:19.838" style="s2">are exactly what she wanted to forget.</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.038" end="01:10:20.838" style="s2">This is karma. I pretended to forget her</p>
<p begin="01:10:19.838" end="01:10:22.637" style="s2">once.</p>
<p begin="01:10:20.838" end="01:10:25.137" style="s2">Now she&#39;s really forgotten me</p>
<p begin="01:10:22.637" end="01:10:25.137" style="s2">completely.</p>
<p begin="01:10:25.438" end="01:10:28.438" style="s2">On the Nordic wind energy deal, their</p>
<p begin="01:10:27.038" end="01:10:30.538" style="s2">board is ready to move. We&#39;ve kept the</p>
<p begin="01:10:28.438" end="01:10:32.038" style="s2">premium under 8% fully aligned with our</p>
<p begin="01:10:30.538" end="01:10:33.637" style="s2">original risk head. Skip the play by</p>
<p begin="01:10:32.038" end="01:10:37.137" style="s2">play. I want a signed agreement on my</p>
<p begin="01:10:33.637" end="01:10:38.738" style="s2">desk before markets open Monday.</p>
<p begin="01:10:37.137" end="01:10:39.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, am I interrupting?</p>
<p begin="01:10:38.738" end="01:10:41.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s her?</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.938" end="01:10:44.538" style="s2">The woman who took down the Kingstons?</p>
<p begin="01:10:41.338" end="01:10:45.938" style="s2">She looks unexpectedly gentle.</p>
<p begin="01:10:44.538" end="01:10:49.137" style="s2">That&#39;s it for tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:10:45.938" end="01:10:49.137" style="s2">My wife brought me dinner.</p>
<p begin="01:10:51.038" end="01:10:54.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your stomach&#39;s not great. You can&#39;t keep</p>
<p begin="01:10:52.637" end="01:10:56.338" style="s2">running on coffee. Open.</p>
<p begin="01:10:54.637" end="01:10:57.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Sinclair,</p>
<p begin="01:10:56.338" end="01:10:59.637" style="s2">your performance is getting very</p>
<p begin="01:10:57.538" end="01:11:01.038" style="s2">convincing. Even I&#39;m starting to lose</p>
<p begin="01:10:59.637" end="01:11:02.637" style="s2">track of what&#39;s real.</p>
<p begin="01:11:01.038" end="01:11:04.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want everyone in Onyx Harbor to see</p>
<p begin="01:11:02.637" end="01:11:06.738" style="s2">how good we are together. That&#39;s how you</p>
<p begin="01:11:04.137" end="01:11:08.338" style="s2">kill the rumors.</p>
<p begin="01:11:06.738" end="01:11:11.338" style="s2">I want them to believe you&#39;re the only</p>
<p begin="01:11:08.338" end="01:11:11.338" style="s2">one that matters to me.</p>
<p begin="01:11:15.137" end="01:11:18.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So this is just a performance.</p>
<p begin="01:11:16.938" end="01:11:20.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You tell me.</p>
<p begin="01:11:18.338" end="01:11:23.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The rumors are true.</p>
<p begin="01:11:20.137" end="01:11:23.238" style="s2">He&#39;s completely taken with her.</p>
<p begin="01:11:23.438" end="01:11:28.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From now on, we treat Mrs. Sinclair with</p>
<p begin="01:11:25.637" end="01:11:28.739" style="s2">more respect than the boss.</p>
<p begin="01:11:30.139" end="01:11:34.639" style="s2">Alex, you seem on edge tonight. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:11:33.039" end="01:11:37.239" style="s2">not like you.</p>
<p begin="01:11:34.639" end="01:11:38.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Against a key energy acquisition.</p>
<p begin="01:11:37.239" end="01:11:41.339" style="s2">Harrison Energy holds the core lithium</p>
<p begin="01:11:38.839" end="01:11:43.539" style="s2">tech, but Harrison himself, old school,</p>
<p begin="01:11:41.339" end="01:11:45.239" style="s2">stubborn, doesn&#39;t bend.</p>
<p begin="01:11:43.539" end="01:11:47.739" style="s2">I&#39;ve reached out three times, got shut</p>
<p begin="01:11:45.239" end="01:11:49.639" style="s2">down every time.</p>
<p begin="01:11:47.739" end="01:11:53.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one&#39;s unbreakable. There&#39;s always a</p>
<p begin="01:11:49.639" end="01:11:53.339" style="s2">weak spot. We&#39;ll find it tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:11:57.439" end="01:12:01.739" style="s2">You&#39;re looking at the setting, right?</p>
<p begin="01:11:59.239" end="01:12:03.439" style="s2">Classic Victorian, but that claw work,</p>
<p begin="01:12:01.739" end="01:12:04.039" style="s2">almost impossible to restore properly</p>
<p begin="01:12:03.439" end="01:12:05.839" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="01:12:04.039" end="01:12:08.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You noticed that?</p>
<p begin="01:12:05.839" end="01:12:09.039" style="s2">Most jewelers now, they only care about</p>
<p begin="01:12:08.239" end="01:12:11.239" style="s2">size.</p>
<p begin="01:12:09.039" end="01:12:13.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jewelry isn&#39;t just for show. It holds</p>
<p begin="01:12:11.239" end="01:12:15.239" style="s2">time in it. Just like Harrison Energy,</p>
<p begin="01:12:13.439" end="01:12:17.339" style="s2">it&#39;s not just about extraction. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:12:15.239" end="01:12:20.239" style="s2">about respect for what you&#39;re taking.</p>
<p begin="01:12:17.339" end="01:12:20.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Make some room.</p>
<p begin="01:12:20.739" end="01:12:25.539" style="s2">Sinclair, want Harrison&#39;s deal? Start</p>
<p begin="01:12:23.439" end="01:12:27.539" style="s2">here. Finish this bourbon. Show me your</p>
<p begin="01:12:25.539" end="01:12:29.439" style="s2">sincerity.</p>
<p begin="01:12:27.539" end="01:12:32.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From a logical standpoint, this is an</p>
<p begin="01:12:29.439" end="01:12:32.539" style="s2">interesting proposal.</p>
<p begin="01:12:33.439" end="01:12:36.539" style="s2">Mr. Miller, my husband&#39;s not drinking</p>
<p begin="01:12:35.039" end="01:12:39.739" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:12:36.539" end="01:12:41.439" style="s2">Doctor&#39;s orders, no hard liquor.</p>
<p begin="01:12:39.739" end="01:12:43.639" style="s2">But if you need a show of good faith,</p>
<p begin="01:12:41.439" end="01:12:45.239" style="s2">I&#39;ll cover it.</p>
<p begin="01:12:43.639" end="01:12:46.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When a couple stands united, they&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:12:45.239" end="01:12:50.839" style="s2">hard to beat.</p>
<p begin="01:12:46.739" end="01:12:50.839" style="s2">That young man married well.</p>
<p begin="01:12:54.439" end="01:12:57.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now that&#39;s control.</p>
<p begin="01:12:56.639" end="01:12:59.539" style="s2">Sinclair,</p>
<p begin="01:12:57.939" end="01:13:01.639" style="s2">not many people play this boldly on a</p>
<p begin="01:12:59.539" end="01:13:03.539" style="s2">green.</p>
<p begin="01:13:01.639" end="01:13:06.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Same in business.</p>
<p begin="01:13:03.539" end="01:13:06.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well said.</p>
<p begin="01:13:11.139" end="01:13:14.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You take very good care of him. Not many</p>
<p begin="01:13:12.939" end="01:13:15.239" style="s2">young women have the patience for this</p>
<p begin="01:13:14.639" end="01:13:17.239" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.239" end="01:13:18.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In Onyx Port, everyone&#39;s chasing what&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:13:17.239" end="01:13:21.939" style="s2">next.</p>
<p begin="01:13:18.539" end="01:13:23.839" style="s2">I&#39;d rather hold on to what matters.</p>
<p begin="01:13:21.939" end="01:13:26.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like Alexander?</p>
<p begin="01:13:23.839" end="01:13:29.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He handles everything out there, the</p>
<p begin="01:13:26.039" end="01:13:31.440" style="s2">pressure, the noise, the rumors.</p>
<p begin="01:13:29.039" end="01:13:33.640" style="s2">The The I can do is there when he comes</p>
<p begin="01:13:31.440" end="01:13:35.240" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="01:13:33.640" end="01:13:37.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These days,</p>
<p begin="01:13:35.240" end="01:13:39.740" style="s2">girls want diamonds.</p>
<p begin="01:13:37.340" end="01:13:41.140" style="s2">But they forget diamonds need a setting.</p>
<p begin="01:13:39.740" end="01:13:42.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="01:13:41.140" end="01:13:46.340" style="s2">Without a strong setting, even the</p>
<p begin="01:13:42.840" end="01:13:46.340" style="s2">brightest diamond won&#39;t last.</p>
<p begin="01:13:46.940" end="01:13:51.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sinclair, I turned you down three times</p>
<p begin="01:13:49.740" end="01:13:53.240" style="s2">because you looked like a man with no</p>
<p begin="01:13:51.140" end="01:13:54.840" style="s2">weak spots.</p>
<p begin="01:13:53.240" end="01:13:56.440" style="s2">And men like that usually have no</p>
<p begin="01:13:54.840" end="01:14:00.040" style="s2">boundaries.</p>
<p begin="01:13:56.440" end="01:14:02.540" style="s2">But today, I saw your foundation.</p>
<p begin="01:14:00.040" end="01:14:04.740" style="s2">A man who earns a woman like her,</p>
<p begin="01:14:02.540" end="01:14:07.640" style="s2">to women like her, doesn&#39;t break his</p>
<p begin="01:14:04.740" end="01:14:09.540" style="s2">word. Congratulations. The lithium mine</p>
<p begin="01:14:07.640" end="01:14:10.940" style="s2">is yours.</p>
<p begin="01:14:09.540" end="01:14:13.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:14:10.940" end="01:14:13.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:14:15.940" end="01:14:19.340" style="s2">We did it, Alex.</p>
<p begin="01:14:17.840" end="01:14:22.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, partner.</p>
<p begin="01:14:19.340" end="01:14:25.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In this jungle, love isn&#39;t a weakness.</p>
<p begin="01:14:22.240" end="01:14:25.540" style="s2">It&#39;s our strongest advantage.</p>
<p begin="01:14:28.940" end="01:14:32.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex, billion dollar deal tonight, and</p>
<p begin="01:14:31.140" end="01:14:33.540" style="s2">that&#39;s all you&#39;re drinking? That&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="01:14:32.440" end="01:14:35.040" style="s2">the guy we know.</p>
<p begin="01:14:33.540" end="01:14:37.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, what happened? You land Harrison</p>
<p begin="01:14:35.040" end="01:14:40.940" style="s2">and suddenly go clean?</p>
<p begin="01:14:37.440" end="01:14:43.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No choice. My wife runs a tight ship.</p>
<p begin="01:14:40.940" end="01:14:46.140" style="s2">Truth is, closing Harrison, that was all</p>
<p begin="01:14:43.240" end="01:14:48.140" style="s2">her. I just signed the papers.</p>
<p begin="01:14:46.140" end="01:14:51.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve all been wondering, how did you</p>
<p begin="01:14:48.140" end="01:14:51.040" style="s2">even win her over?</p>
<p begin="01:14:51.540" end="01:14:54.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Most people think it was about business.</p>
<p begin="01:14:53.440" end="01:14:55.840" style="s2">It wasn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:14:54.440" end="01:14:57.440" style="s2">I tracked down a stack of sketchbooks</p>
<p begin="01:14:55.840" end="01:14:58.840" style="s2">she lost years ago.</p>
<p begin="01:14:57.440" end="01:15:00.240" style="s2">Every bookstore, every underground</p>
<p begin="01:14:58.840" end="01:15:01.840" style="s2">gallery she&#39;d ever been to, I went</p>
<p begin="01:15:00.240" end="01:15:04.340" style="s2">through all of them. The moment I gave</p>
<p begin="01:15:01.840" end="01:15:04.940" style="s2">them back and saw her smile, that was</p>
<p begin="01:15:04.340" end="01:15:06.740" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="01:15:04.940" end="01:15:08.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, that&#39;s Alexander? He went digging</p>
<p begin="01:15:06.740" end="01:15:09.340" style="s2">through old book rooms for a woman?</p>
<p begin="01:15:08.240" end="01:15:10.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never thought I&#39;d see this side of him.</p>
<p begin="01:15:09.340" end="01:15:12.840" style="s2">Guess Mrs. Sinclair really is his soft</p>
<p begin="01:15:10.740" end="01:15:12.840" style="s2">spot.</p>
<p begin="01:15:20.540" end="01:15:26.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Been waiting long, Mrs. Sinclair?</p>
<p begin="01:15:23.440" end="01:15:29.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just got here. They finally let you go?</p>
<p begin="01:15:26.040" end="01:15:29.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Told them my wife was calling me home.</p>
<p begin="01:15:33.540" end="01:15:36.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have you heard at the Harrison</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.742" end="01:15:37.942" style="s2">celebration last night, Alexander left</p>
<p begin="01:15:36.442" end="01:15:39.142" style="s2">early just to go home with his wife.</p>
<p begin="01:15:37.942" end="01:15:40.442" style="s2">Didn&#39;t even finish his drink.</p>
<p begin="01:15:39.142" end="01:15:41.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s old news. It&#39;s all over the</p>
<p begin="01:15:40.442" end="01:15:43.342" style="s2">circle now. They&#39;re saying he tracked</p>
<p begin="01:15:41.642" end="01:15:44.942" style="s2">down Elena&#39;s old sketchbooks, hit every</p>
<p begin="01:15:43.342" end="01:15:46.742" style="s2">used bookstore and underground gallery</p>
<p begin="01:15:44.942" end="01:15:48.642" style="s2">she&#39;d ever been to. A guy like him, when</p>
<p begin="01:15:46.742" end="01:15:51.042" style="s2">he falls, he falls hard. How did you let</p>
<p begin="01:15:48.642" end="01:15:52.842" style="s2">someone like her slip away? If she were</p>
<p begin="01:15:51.042" end="01:15:54.942" style="s2">still with the Kingsleys, all of this</p>
<p begin="01:15:52.842" end="01:15:57.542" style="s2">would belong to your family, not the St.</p>
<p begin="01:15:54.942" end="01:15:57.542" style="s2">Clairs.</p>
<p begin="01:15:57.642" end="01:16:01.942" style="s2">The Kingsley family has standards. A</p>
<p begin="01:15:59.842" end="01:16:05.542" style="s2">woman that calculating,</p>
<p begin="01:16:01.942" end="01:16:05.542" style="s2">she&#39;s better suited for the St. Clairs.</p>
<p begin="01:16:05.942" end="01:16:08.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That</p>
<p begin="01:16:07.142" end="01:16:11.042" style="s2">She didn&#39;t lose her memory. She&#39;s faking</p>
<p begin="01:16:08.942" end="01:16:12.942" style="s2">it, using Sebastian to get back at me.</p>
<p begin="01:16:11.042" end="01:16:14.842" style="s2">Why is she still standing? Why isn&#39;t she</p>
<p begin="01:16:12.942" end="01:16:16.942" style="s2">dead?</p>
<p begin="01:16:14.842" end="01:16:18.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I don&#39;t buy it. She didn&#39;t forget</p>
<p begin="01:16:16.942" end="01:16:20.342" style="s2">anything. The higher she climbs, the</p>
<p begin="01:16:18.742" end="01:16:22.042" style="s2">harder I&#39;ll take her down. I&#39;m going to</p>
<p begin="01:16:20.342" end="01:16:24.042" style="s2">rip that fake mask right off her face.</p>
<p begin="01:16:22.042" end="01:16:25.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy. Don&#39;t stress the baby. I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:16:24.042" end="01:16:27.642" style="s2">already hired the best PI in Onyxport.</p>
<p begin="01:16:25.942" end="01:16:29.542" style="s2">Everything from that party 10 years ago,</p>
<p begin="01:16:27.642" end="01:16:29.842" style="s2">even the man involved, I&#39;ll dig it all</p>
<p begin="01:16:29.542" end="01:16:32.042" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="01:16:29.842" end="01:16:33.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect. Elena,</p>
<p begin="01:16:32.042" end="01:16:35.942" style="s2">since you love digging into the past,</p>
<p begin="01:16:33.942" end="01:16:38.242" style="s2">I&#39;ll help you dig deeper. Right when</p>
<p begin="01:16:35.942" end="01:16:42.842" style="s2">you&#39;re at the top, you&#39;ll watch your</p>
<p begin="01:16:38.242" end="01:16:42.842" style="s2">dirty past drag you straight down.</p>
<p begin="01:16:47.642" end="01:16:54.042" style="s2">Alexander&#39;s about to find out</p>
<p begin="01:16:50.142" end="01:16:54.042" style="s2">what he&#39;s really been holding on to.</p>
<p begin="01:16:58.458" end="01:17:00.478" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:17:02.542" end="01:17:06.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ready?</p>
<p begin="01:17:03.842" end="01:17:06.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ready.</p>
<p begin="01:17:13.342" end="01:17:18.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome to Aura Jewelry. Tonight, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:17:16.142" end="01:17:20.642" style="s2">introducing a new collection, the</p>
<p begin="01:17:18.442" end="01:17:22.342" style="s2">Origin.</p>
<p begin="01:17:20.642" end="01:17:24.742" style="s2">Every piece in this collection holds a</p>
<p begin="01:17:22.342" end="01:17:26.942" style="s2">memory that can&#39;t be replaced.</p>
<p begin="01:17:24.742" end="01:17:29.942" style="s2">I remember that corner bookstand.</p>
<p begin="01:17:26.942" end="01:17:32.142" style="s2">It was my only safe place growing up.</p>
<p begin="01:17:29.942" end="01:17:34.642" style="s2">There was a boy who sat there with me.</p>
<p begin="01:17:32.142" end="01:17:36.542" style="s2">We read every book of poetry togeth-</p>
<p begin="01:17:34.642" end="01:17:38.843" style="s2">Then these anemones.</p>
<p begin="01:17:36.542" end="01:17:41.243" style="s2">Someone once an entire field outside my</p>
<p begin="01:17:38.843" end="01:17:41.243" style="s2">window.</p>
<p begin="01:17:41.843" end="01:17:45.343" style="s2">Just to make me smile.</p>
<p begin="01:17:43.543" end="01:17:47.943" style="s2">And this brooch</p>
<p begin="01:17:45.343" end="01:17:49.943" style="s2">was my mother Diana&#39;s. It was broken</p>
<p begin="01:17:47.943" end="01:17:51.343" style="s2">just like I was, but with someone&#39;s help</p>
<p begin="01:17:49.943" end="01:17:53.643" style="s2">I restored it.</p>
<p begin="01:17:51.343" end="01:17:55.843" style="s2">And in doing that I put myself back</p>
<p begin="01:17:53.643" end="01:17:59.643" style="s2">together too. This collection is my</p>
<p begin="01:17:55.843" end="01:18:03.443" style="s2">confession to my husband, Alexander.</p>
<p begin="01:17:59.643" end="01:18:05.543" style="s2">Thank you for finding me again.</p>
<p begin="01:18:03.443" end="01:18:06.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That book stand, I was there with her.</p>
<p begin="01:18:05.543" end="01:18:08.544" style="s2">Those flowers, I planted them too. And</p>
<p begin="01:18:06.943" end="01:18:09.143" style="s2">that brooch</p>
<p begin="01:18:08.544" end="01:18:10.943" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:18:09.143" end="01:18:12.943" style="s2">Diana gave it to me before she died. She</p>
<p begin="01:18:10.943" end="01:18:13.943" style="s2">trusted me to protect Elena and I</p>
<p begin="01:18:12.943" end="01:18:16.043" style="s2">didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:18:13.943" end="01:18:18.043" style="s2">I pushed her away and let those 10 years</p>
<p begin="01:18:16.043" end="01:18:18.643" style="s2">of her memory of me become another</p>
<p begin="01:18:18.043" end="01:18:22.043" style="s2">man&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="01:18:18.643" end="01:18:24.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And now for the final piece tonight</p>
<p begin="01:18:22.043" end="01:18:26.643" style="s2">before everyone gets swept up in this</p>
<p begin="01:18:24.043" end="01:18:28.543" style="s2">touching love story, why don&#39;t we take a</p>
<p begin="01:18:26.643" end="01:18:32.243" style="s2">look at what this Mrs. Sinclair was</p>
<p begin="01:18:28.543" end="01:18:32.243" style="s2">really like 10 years ago.</p>
<p begin="01:18:33.643" end="01:18:38.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t let her fool you. She never lost</p>
<p begin="01:18:35.643" end="01:18:41.243" style="s2">her memory. All that redemption, all</p>
<p begin="01:18:38.143" end="01:18:42.843" style="s2">that origin, it&#39;s all a setup. She&#39;ll do</p>
<p begin="01:18:41.243" end="01:18:44.943" style="s2">anything TO CLAW HER WAY UP.</p>
<p begin="01:18:42.843" end="01:18:46.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ISABELLA?</p>
<p begin="01:18:44.943" end="01:18:47.843" style="s2">What are you talking about?</p>
<p begin="01:18:46.243" end="01:18:50.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still playing the part?</p>
<p begin="01:18:47.843" end="01:18:50.143" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:18:50.343" end="01:18:56.443" style="s2">Let&#39;s show everyone what&#39;s really behind</p>
<p begin="01:18:52.543" end="01:18:57.443" style="s2">your art and just how dirty it gets.</p>
<p begin="01:18:56.443" end="01:19:00.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:18:57.443" end="01:19:01.943" style="s2">10 years ago that wasn&#39;t an accident.</p>
<p begin="01:19:00.243" end="01:19:04.843" style="s2">Elena came to me,</p>
<p begin="01:19:01.943" end="01:19:07.043" style="s2">paid me 50 grand, told me to stage an</p>
<p begin="01:19:04.843" end="01:19:09.743" style="s2">assault, make the Kingsley heir feel</p>
<p begin="01:19:07.043" end="01:19:12.943" style="s2">sorry for her, lock him in. That woman,</p>
<p begin="01:19:09.743" end="01:19:12.943" style="s2">she&#39;s colder than anyone.</p>
<p begin="01:19:16.743" end="01:19:21.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just a $50,000 act? Mr. Sinclair, DID</p>
<p begin="01:19:19.443" end="01:19:24.243" style="s2">YOU KNOW ABOUT THIS? HAS THE SINCLAIR</p>
<p begin="01:19:21.143" end="01:19:24.243" style="s2">family been played?</p>
<p begin="01:19:28.143" end="01:19:32.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are the police? Arrest her. SHE&#39;S</p>
<p begin="01:19:30.543" end="01:19:34.843" style="s2">A FRAUD. SHE DOESN&#39;T DESERVE ANY OF</p>
<p begin="01:19:32.543" end="01:19:34.843" style="s2">THIS.</p>
<p begin="01:19:39.590" end="01:19:41.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:19:43.344" end="01:19:45.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DOMINIC.</p>
<p begin="01:19:46.244" end="01:19:51.744" style="s2">If they want the truth,</p>
<p begin="01:19:48.344" end="01:19:51.744" style="s2">then show them the real version.</p>
<p begin="01:19:58.844" end="01:20:03.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll talk. I&#39;ll tell you everything. 10</p>
<p begin="01:20:01.045" end="01:20:06.644" style="s2">years ago, it was Catherine. She came to</p>
<p begin="01:20:03.644" end="01:20:08.545" style="s2">me herself, paid me 50 grand, [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:20:06.644" end="01:20:10.045" style="s2">told me to bring guys,</p>
<p begin="01:20:08.545" end="01:20:12.244" style="s2">ruin Elena, get her kicked out of the</p>
<p begin="01:20:10.045" end="01:20:13.650" style="s2">Kingsley&#39;s so Isabella could take her</p>
<p begin="01:20:12.244" end="01:20:14.744" style="s2">place.</p>
<p begin="01:20:13.650" end="01:20:16.945" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:20:14.744" end="01:20:20.445" style="s2">That video just now,</p>
<p begin="01:20:16.945" end="01:20:22.244" style="s2">they forced me to record it. Please,</p>
<p begin="01:20:20.445" end="01:20:24.844" style="s2">JUST LET ME GO.</p>
<p begin="01:20:22.244" end="01:20:27.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MRS. KINGSLEY, CARE TO EXPLAIN THIS? You</p>
<p begin="01:20:24.844" end="01:20:27.744" style="s2">destroyed an 18 year old&#39;s life for</p>
<p begin="01:20:27.045" end="01:20:29.545" style="s2">power?</p>
<p begin="01:20:27.744" end="01:20:30.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Isabella, you called her a fraud.</p>
<p begin="01:20:29.545" end="01:20:33.644" style="s2">Looks like the real monster&#39;s been</p>
<p begin="01:20:30.744" end="01:20:33.644" style="s2">sitting right here.</p>
<p begin="01:20:38.344" end="01:20:43.244" style="s2">No, it&#39;s fake. ALEXANDER SET THIS UP.</p>
<p begin="01:20:41.445" end="01:20:46.045" style="s2">He&#39;s protecting THAT YOU&#39;RE ALL</p>
<p begin="01:20:43.244" end="01:20:46.045" style="s2">BEING FOOLED.</p>
<p begin="01:20:47.545" end="01:20:51.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since everyone&#39;s so interested in what</p>
<p begin="01:20:49.344" end="01:20:53.344" style="s2">happened 10 years ago,</p>
<p begin="01:20:51.445" end="01:20:54.445" style="s2">we&#39;ll let the law handle the truth.</p>
<p begin="01:20:53.344" end="01:20:58.344" style="s2">Dominic,</p>
<p begin="01:20:54.445" end="01:20:58.344" style="s2">turn over everything to the police.</p>
<p begin="01:21:08.344" end="01:21:11.344" style="s2">This press conference isn&#39;t about</p>
<p begin="01:21:09.445" end="01:21:12.744" style="s2">financials. It&#39;s about what happened a</p>
<p begin="01:21:11.344" end="01:21:14.644" style="s2">few days ago.</p>
<p begin="01:21:12.744" end="01:21:17.144" style="s2">It&#39;s about my wife, and I won&#39;t let</p>
<p begin="01:21:14.644" end="01:21:19.644" style="s2">anyone smear her name.</p>
<p begin="01:21:17.144" end="01:21:22.144" style="s2">Before anything else,</p>
<p begin="01:21:19.644" end="01:21:23.644" style="s2">look at this. 20 years ago, in a small</p>
<p begin="01:21:22.144" end="01:21:24.945" style="s2">town in England,</p>
<p begin="01:21:23.644" end="01:21:26.045" style="s2">there was a boy</p>
<p begin="01:21:24.945" end="01:21:28.244" style="s2">beaten, forgotten.</p>
<p begin="01:21:26.045" end="01:21:31.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After a snowstorm, a little girl named</p>
<p begin="01:21:28.244" end="01:21:31.445" style="s2">Elena found him.</p>
<p begin="01:21:36.644" end="01:21:40.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is for you.</p>
<p begin="01:21:38.144" end="01:21:41.744" style="s2">My grandma says black stones protect</p>
<p begin="01:21:40.344" end="01:21:46.046" style="s2">brave people.</p>
<p begin="01:21:41.744" end="01:21:46.046" style="s2">Eat sweet. It&#39;ll hurt less.</p>
<p begin="01:21:47.946" end="01:21:53.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From that moment on,</p>
<p begin="01:21:49.646" end="01:21:53.446" style="s2">I knew it had to be her.</p>
<p begin="01:21:57.046" end="01:22:01.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So,</p>
<p begin="01:21:58.946" end="01:22:02.745" style="s2">this whole setup was for a love</p>
<p begin="01:22:01.046" end="01:22:04.845" style="s2">confession? Then I guess I have</p>
<p begin="01:22:02.745" end="01:22:06.745" style="s2">something to say too.</p>
<p begin="01:22:04.845" end="01:22:09.845" style="s2">This was never one-sided</p>
<p begin="01:22:06.745" end="01:22:09.845" style="s2">because I love him too.</p>
<p begin="01:22:14.745" end="01:22:16.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir,</p>
<p begin="01:22:15.546" end="01:22:17.946" style="s2">ma&#39;am,</p>
<p begin="01:22:16.546" end="01:22:20.446" style="s2">Isabella and Catherine have been taken</p>
<p begin="01:22:17.946" end="01:22:21.845" style="s2">into custody defamation and aggravated</p>
<p begin="01:22:20.446" end="01:22:23.446" style="s2">assault. Arrest went through 10 minutes</p>
<p begin="01:22:21.845" end="01:22:24.845" style="s2">ago.</p>
<p begin="01:22:23.446" end="01:22:27.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena,</p>
<p begin="01:22:24.845" end="01:22:29.946" style="s2">this is the Blackwood&#39;s worst secret.</p>
<p begin="01:22:27.546" end="01:22:32.146" style="s2">Your mother&#39;s death.</p>
<p begin="01:22:29.946" end="01:22:33.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We verified everything. It wasn&#39;t an</p>
<p begin="01:22:32.146" end="01:22:36.146" style="s2">accident.</p>
<p begin="01:22:33.745" end="01:22:38.646" style="s2">Charles cut the brake line himself.</p>
<p begin="01:22:36.146" end="01:22:41.446" style="s2">He was after Diana&#39;s trust.</p>
<p begin="01:22:38.646" end="01:22:43.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s going to pay for this.</p>
<p begin="01:22:41.446" end="01:22:45.245" style="s2">Charles Blackwood, you really thought</p>
<p begin="01:22:43.646" end="01:22:47.345" style="s2">you buried it?</p>
<p begin="01:22:45.245" end="01:22:48.146" style="s2">10 years and no one would find out you</p>
<p begin="01:22:47.345" end="01:22:50.345" style="s2">killed my mom?</p>
<p begin="01:22:48.146" end="01:22:51.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena, what are you saying? I&#39;m your</p>
<p begin="01:22:50.345" end="01:22:53.646" style="s2">father.</p>
<p begin="01:22:51.546" end="01:22:57.446" style="s2">Don&#39;t let them turn you against me.</p>
<p begin="01:22:53.646" end="01:23:00.046" style="s2">Elena, please. We&#39;re family. Help me.</p>
<p begin="01:22:57.446" end="01:23:01.946" style="s2">Everything I did was for this family.</p>
<p begin="01:23:00.046" end="01:23:03.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You stopped being my father the second</p>
<p begin="01:23:01.946" end="01:23:06.146" style="s2">you killed her.</p>
<p begin="01:23:03.345" end="01:23:06.146" style="s2">You&#39;re a murderer.</p>
<p begin="01:23:06.646" end="01:23:10.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Breaking, Blackwood Group Chairman</p>
<p begin="01:23:08.146" end="01:23:12.245" style="s2">Charles Blackwood has been arrested in</p>
<p begin="01:23:10.146" end="01:23:14.745" style="s2">connection with a murder case from 10</p>
<p begin="01:23:12.245" end="01:23:16.646" style="s2">years ago. St. Clair Capital has also</p>
<p begin="01:23:14.745" end="01:23:18.646" style="s2">confirmed a full exaction of Blackwood</p>
<p begin="01:23:16.646" end="01:23:22.646" style="s2">Real Estate.</p>
<p begin="01:23:18.646" end="01:23:22.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10 years, I had it all.</p>
<p begin="01:23:26.646" end="01:23:29.046" style="s2">Airport.</p>
<p begin="01:23:34.245" end="01:23:39.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s done</p>
<p begin="01:23:36.446" end="01:23:39.245" style="s2">for my boy.</p>
<p begin="01:23:40.046" end="01:23:44.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love it. Best gift I ever had.</p>
<p begin="01:23:43.345" end="01:23:45.247" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It holds everything we&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="01:23:44.747" end="01:23:47.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; through.</p>
<p begin="01:23:45.247" end="01:23:49.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s go build what comes next.</p>
<p begin="01:23:47.647" end="01:23:49.947" style="s2">Come with me.</p>
<p begin="01:23:53.847" end="01:23:57.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena,</p>
<p begin="01:23:55.647" end="01:24:00.047" style="s2">we started as a deal,</p>
<p begin="01:23:57.647" end="01:24:02.247" style="s2">but I don&#39;t want it to end that way.</p>
<p begin="01:24:00.047" end="01:24:03.647" style="s2">I want to turn it into something real.</p>
<p begin="01:24:02.247" end="01:24:04.647" style="s2">Will you be my wife</p>
<p begin="01:24:03.647" end="01:24:06.447" style="s2">for real?</p>
<p begin="01:24:04.647" end="01:24:08.247" style="s2">Let me take care of you for the rest of</p>
<p begin="01:24:06.447" end="01:24:09.847" style="s2">our lives.</p>
<p begin="01:24:08.247" end="01:24:13.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:24:09.847" end="01:24:13.147" style="s2">Yes, Alex, I will.</p>
<p begin="01:24:21.243" end="01:24:23.263" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:24:27.447" end="01:24:31.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From today on, you&#39;re my one and only,</p>
<p begin="01:24:30.447" end="01:24:34.147" style="s2">my home.</p>
<p begin="01:24:31.347" end="01:24:35.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From today on, you&#39;re my anchor,</p>
<p begin="01:24:34.147" end="01:24:37.847" style="s2">my everything. Feels like our story</p>
<p begin="01:24:35.947" end="01:24:39.447" style="s2">could have been a whole series.</p>
<p begin="01:24:37.847" end="01:24:43.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:24:39.447" end="01:24:43.147" style="s2">That part&#39;s over. Now it&#39;s just us.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
